Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.75,0:00:31.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙魔方已经苏醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Tesseract has awakened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.35,0:00:37.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它在一个渺小的世界里 人类的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is on a little world, a human world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.79,0:00:40.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类想利用其能量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They would wield its power,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.35,0:00:47.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可只有我们的盟友会使用它 人类是痴心妄想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but our ally knows its workings as they never will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.10,0:00:51.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他将作为先锋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is ready to lead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.26,0:00:57.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我们齐塔瑞人的大军则紧随其后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and our force, our Chitauri, will follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.40,0:01:01.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他一个地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A world will be his.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:04.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要全宇宙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The universe, yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.08,0:01:10.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类何力抵抗 只能等死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the humans, what can they do but burn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.10,0:01:27.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"全体人员注意"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"All personnel,"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.30,0:01:29.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"已确认撤离…"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"the evacuation order has been confirmed."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.14,0:01:33.21,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,(联合暗能行动){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.10,0:02:02.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情况有多糟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How bad is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.70,0:02:05.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官 最糟的正是情况尚不明朗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's the problem, sir. We don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:12.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塞尔维格博士4小时前检测到宇宙魔方发出了一股能量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dr Selvig read an energy surge from the Tesseract four hours ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.50,0:02:14.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇航局没允许塞尔维格做测试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}NASA didn't authorise Selvig to go to test phase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.50,0:02:18.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他没做测试 他当时根本不在 是自动触发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He wasn't testing it. He wasn't even in the room.Spontaneous event.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.50,0:02:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙魔方自行启动了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It just turned itself on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.78,0:02:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在达到什么能级了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where are the energy levels now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.14,0:02:21.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还在攀升{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Climbing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.83,0:02:22.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塞尔维格不能关掉它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When Selvig couldn't shut it down,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.81,0:02:23.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只好下令撤离{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we ordered evac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.59,0:02:24.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全员撤离还需多久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How long to get everyone out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.62,0:02:25.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,半小时内应该能撤完{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Campus should be clear in the next half-hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.10,0:02:27.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.22,0:02:31.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官 撤离或许是徒劳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir, evacuation may be futile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.30,0:02:32.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要我喊大伙儿回去睡觉吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We should tell them to go back to sleep?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.82,0:02:34.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果控制不住宇宙魔方的能量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If we can't control the Tesseract's energy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.14,0:02:37.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逃多远可能都没用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there may not be a minimum safe distance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.50,0:02:38.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去监督转移{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need you to make sure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.62,0:02:40.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二阶段所有原型机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Phase 2 prototypes are shipped out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.38,0:02:42.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官 现在还要顾及那个吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir, is that really a priority right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.54,0:02:44.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球还照常转{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Until such time as the world ends,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.30,0:02:46.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就照常过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we will act as though it intends to spin on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.18,0:02:48.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搬走下面全部设备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Clear out the tech below.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.70,0:02:51.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将第二阶段所有设备装车运走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Every piece of Phase 2 on a truck and gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.30,0:02:52.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遵命 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.74,0:02:53.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.60,0:02:58.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士 什么情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Talk to me, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.28,0:03:01.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,局长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Director.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.80,0:03:03.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在到底掌握了些什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is there anything we know for certain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.60,0:03:05.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙魔方在淘气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Tesseract is misbehaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:08.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你在说笑吗 - 这一点也不好笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Is that supposed to be funny? - No, it's not funny at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.84,0:03:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙魔方开始活动 而且不听使唤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Tesseract is not only active, she's behaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.00,0:03:13.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你试过切断电源了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I assume you pulled the plug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.16,0:03:15.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她自身就是能量源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's an energy source.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.00,0:03:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们关上电源 她又给打开了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We turn off the power, she turns it back on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.12,0:03:20.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是她达到峰值能级{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If she reaches peak level...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.67,0:03:22.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不就在为此做准备吗 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We prepared for this, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.44,0:03:23.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,利用来自宇宙的能量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Harnessing energy from space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.84,0:03:25.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还没那金刚钻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But we don't have the harness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.80,0:03:27.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的测算还差的远呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My calculations are far from complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.56,0:03:29.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在释放干扰和辐射{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And she's throwing off interference, radiation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.20,0:03:31.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没多大危害 只是低能级的伽马射线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing harmful, low levels of gamma radiation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.72,0:03:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那也可能有危害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That can be harmful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.68,0:03:36.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴顿探员呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where's Agent Barton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:37.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老鹰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Hawk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.68,0:03:40.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然是窝在巢里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Up in his nest, as usual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.70,0:03:44.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴顿探员 请回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Agent Barton, report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:46.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你这个任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I gave you this detail{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.50,0:03:48.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是让你盯紧这里的情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so you could keep a close eye on things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.22,0:03:49.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,远点看得更清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, I see better from a distance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.74,0:03:51.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到是什么激活了她吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you seen anything that might set this thing off?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.06,0:03:54.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士 能量又激增了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doctor, it's spiking again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.30,0:03:55.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人进出{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No one's come or gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.82,0:03:57.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塞尔维格没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Selvig's clean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.58,0:03:59.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有与人接触或传递信息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No contacts, no IMs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.50,0:04:01.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有谁在搞鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If there was any tampering, sir,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.76,0:04:03.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不是我们这边的人 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it wasn't at this end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.20,0:04:05.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"At this end"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.14,0:04:09.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔方不是通向宇宙另一端的门吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, the Cube is a doorway to the other end of space, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.58,0:04:12.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门从两边都能开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doors open from both sides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.54,0:04:14.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别急啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.20,0:05:26.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生 请放下你的矛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir, please put down the spear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.10,0:06:07.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还有点灵气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.70,0:06:39.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别拿走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:42.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还要用呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I still need that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.22,0:06:43.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没必要把事情闹得更大了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This doesn't have to get any messier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:44.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然有必要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course it does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.18,0:06:46.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我费尽周折 就是为了它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've come too far for anything else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.86,0:06:52.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是来自阿斯加德的洛基{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am Loki, of Asgard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.22,0:06:54.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我肩负光荣使命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I am burdened with glorious purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.70,0:06:56.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛基{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Loki,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.54,0:06:57.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是托尔他弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}brother of Thor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.20,0:07:00.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们跟你们毫无纠葛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have no quarrel with your people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.54,0:07:04.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蚂蚁也没去招惹靴子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An ant has no quarrel with a boot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.20,0:07:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要踩死我们吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you planning to step on us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.20,0:07:10.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我带来了佳音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I come with glad tidings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.36,0:07:13.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要给你们解脱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of a world made free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.56,0:07:14.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么解脱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Free from what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.72,0:07:15.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终结自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.52,0:07:19.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自由是人生的一大的骗局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Freedom is life's great lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.24,0:07:22.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你能承认这一点 你的内心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Once you accept that, in your heart,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.84,0:07:28.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能获得安宁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you will know peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.92,0:07:31.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你嘴上说安宁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, you say "Peace,"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.20,0:07:33.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我倒觉得你想挑起动乱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I kind of think you mean the other thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.16,0:07:36.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,头儿 弗瑞局长在拖延时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir, Director Fury is stalling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.76,0:07:38.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就要爆炸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This place is about to blow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.16,0:07:39.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会被压在三十多米的石块之下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and drop a hundred feet of rock on us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.24,0:07:43.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想害我们被活埋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He means to bury us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.44,0:07:44.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像奥丁的法老一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like the pharaohs of old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.72,0:07:46.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说得对 传送门在自我坍圮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's right. The portal is collapsing in on itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.80,0:07:48.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再有两分钟 就会达到临界状态{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We've got maybe two minutes before this goes critical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.28,0:07:50.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.36,0:08:06.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要用这些车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need these vehicles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.12,0:08:13.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是谁 - 不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Who's that? - They didn't tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.24,0:08:17.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.84,0:08:19.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听得到吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.76,0:08:21.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴顿被黑化了…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Barton has turned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.56,0:08:37.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们抢走了宇宙魔方 拦下他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They have the Tesseract! Shut them down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.20,0:09:16.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走吧 别管了 算了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, let's go. No, leave it. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.12,0:09:34.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,楼上撤空了 长官 得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're clear upstairs, sir. You need to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.36,0:11:07.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,局长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Director?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.96,0:11:09.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗瑞局长 听到了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Director Fury, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.60,0:11:11.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙魔方被敌人夺走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Tesseract is with a hostile force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:14.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人负伤 希尔汇报情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have men down. Hill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.68,0:11:16.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有很多人被埋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A lot of men still under.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.68,0:11:18.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知有多少人生还{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know how many survivors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.52,0:11:19.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发出全局通令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sound a general call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.84,0:11:22.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有未参与救援的人都去找那个箱子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want every living soul not working rescue looking for that briefcase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.00,0:11:24.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Roger that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.20,0:11:28.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科尔森 回基地去 这是7级事件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Coulson, get back to base. This is a Level Seven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.40,0:11:30.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从此刻起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As of right now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.12,0:11:32.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们开战了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we are at war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.16,0:11:35.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.30,0:11:48.58,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,《复仇者联盟》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.20,0:12:15.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚和我预想的不太一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is not how I wanted this evening to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.88,0:12:17.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你是怎么想的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know how you wanted this evening to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.64,0:12:18.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Believe me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.80,0:12:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样好一些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}this is better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.72,0:12:22.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给谁卖命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who are you working for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.88,0:12:24.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是勒曼托夫吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lermentov, yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.28,0:12:27.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他觉得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does he think{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.28,0:12:29.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还需要他点头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we have to go through him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.28,0:12:31.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才能运我们的货吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to move our cargo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.88,0:12:37.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是索罗霍布将军负责出口生意吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought General Solohob is in charge of the export business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.40,0:12:40.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,索罗霍布{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Solohob{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.48,0:12:42.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是个中间人 幌子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a bagman, a front.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.80,0:12:48.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过时的情报害了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your outdated information betrays you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.32,0:12:52.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赫赫有名的黑寡妇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The famous Black Widow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:58.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不过就是长得漂亮而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and she turns out to be simply another pretty face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.60,0:13:03.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真觉得我漂亮吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You really think I'm pretty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.08,0:13:11.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉勒曼托夫 不劳他大驾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell Lermentov we don't need him to move the tanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.88,0:13:15.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉他 他玩完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell him he is out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.80,0:13:17.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.12,0:13:21.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可能得写下来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}...you may have to write it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.40,0:13:33.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找她的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.12,0:13:38.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You listen carefully...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.48,0:13:40.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在114号索伦斯基广场的三楼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're at 1-14 Silensky Plaza, 3rd floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.20,0:13:43.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,距你不到13公里 有架F-22在待命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have an F-22 exactly eight miles out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.08,0:13:45.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让那女人接电话 否则你跑不到前厅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Put the woman on the phone, or I will blow up the block{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.16,0:13:48.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就炸平整条街{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before you can make the lobby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:57.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你得回来 - 你搞什么啊 我在工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- We need you to come in. - Are you kidding? I'm working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.36,0:13:58.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边得先放放{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This takes precedence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.80,0:14:00.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正在做审讯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm in the middle of an interrogation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:02.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个傻逼什么都招了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This moron is giving me everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.64,0:14:05.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没招啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't give everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.52,0:14:07.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在脱不开身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, you can't pull me out of this right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.96,0:14:08.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娜塔莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Natasha...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.44,0:14:11.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴顿被敌人黑化了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Barton's been compromised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.96,0:14:16.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你等会儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me put you on hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.20,0:15:00.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴顿人呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is Barton now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.32,0:15:01.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不知道 - 他还活着吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- We don't know. - But he's alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.96,0:15:04.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是的 等你回来再细说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We think so. I'll brief you on everything when you get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.88,0:15:06.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你得先去跟大块头谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But first, we need you to talk to the big guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.04,0:15:08.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科尔森 你也知道斯塔克于我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Coulson, you know that Stark{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.22,0:15:09.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毫无信任可言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}trusts me about as far as he can throw me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.20,0:15:13.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 大款我负责 大块头你负责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've got Stark. You get the big guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.28,0:15:38.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.68,0:15:39.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.84,0:15:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里有病人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is sickness here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.36,0:15:45.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是医生吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're a doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.96,0:15:48.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸昏迷不醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My father's not waking up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.32,0:15:50.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他发烧了 还一直难受的叫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has a fever and he's moaning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.20,0:15:51.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但眼睛却睁不开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but his eyes won't open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.36,0:15:52.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Slow down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.80,0:15:54.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My father...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.12,0:15:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像他们一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.92,0:16:03.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.20,0:16:33.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你个笨蛋 该先收钱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You should've got paid up front, Banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.60,0:16:34.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是该{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, for a man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.96,0:16:36.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,远离压力吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who's supposed to be avoiding stress{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.40,0:16:39.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么选这么个地方安居{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you picked a hell of a place to settle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.20,0:16:43.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,远离压力不是我的绝招{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Avoiding stress isn't the secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:45.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么 做瑜伽吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then what is it? Yoga?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.04,0:16:50.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把我引离市区 很明智{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You brought me to the edge of the city. Smart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.64,0:16:54.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里被包围了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I assume the whole place is surrounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.96,0:16:56.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有你我二人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just you and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.48,0:17:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那个小演员呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And your actress buddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.64,0:17:02.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她也是个特工吗 这么小就干上这个了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is she a spy, too? They start that young?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.92,0:17:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当年也很小{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.32,0:17:05.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.52,0:17:06.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娜塔莎·罗曼诺夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Natasha Romanoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.80,0:17:11.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是来杀我的吗 罗曼诺夫小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you here to kill me, Ms Romanoff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.28,0:17:13.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要知道想杀我可没那么容易{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because that's not going to work out for everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.08,0:17:16.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不 当然不是 我代表神盾局而来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, of course not. I'm here on behalf of S.H.I.E.L.D.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.12,0:17:19.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神盾局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}S.H.I.E.L.D.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.28,0:17:23.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们怎么找到我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How did they find me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.40,0:17:24.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一直掌握着你的行踪 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We never lost you, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.16,0:17:26.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是没去打扰你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We've kept our distance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.32,0:17:28.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至替你赶走了一些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even helped keep some other interested parties{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.20,0:17:29.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不速之客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}off your scent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.68,0:17:30.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.76,0:17:33.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼克·弗瑞似乎信任你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nick Fury seems to trust you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.24,0:17:34.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但现在你得跟我走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But now we need you to come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.72,0:17:37.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我不肯呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What if I say no?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.72,0:17:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会说服你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll persuade you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.80,0:17:45.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是…那个家伙不肯呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what if the other guy says no?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.40,0:17:48.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一年多没出过"事故"了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've been more than a year without an incident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.16,0:17:51.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不想破这个戒吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't think you want to break that streak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.76,0:17:56.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是总能把持得住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, I don't every time get what I want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.28,0:18:00.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士 一场全球性的灾难可能就要降临{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doctor, we're facing a potential global catastrophe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.00,0:18:04.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这正是我一心想避免的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, those I actively try to avoid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.00,0:18:06.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.48,0:18:08.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是宇宙魔方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is the Tesseract.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.96,0:18:11.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它有毁灭整个地球的势能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It has the potential energy to wipe out the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.36,0:18:16.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那弗瑞找我干嘛 把它吃掉吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What does Fury want me to do, swallow it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.64,0:18:18.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是要你去找它 它被夺走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He wants you to find it. It's been taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.80,0:18:23.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它发出的伽马信号太弱 我们追踪不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It emits a gamma signature that's too weak for us to trace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.00,0:18:26.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你是最了解伽马射线的人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's no one that knows gamma radiation like you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.20,0:18:29.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则我也不会来找你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If there was, that's where I'd be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.00,0:18:33.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那弗瑞不是派你来捉怪物的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, Fury isn't after the monster?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.28,0:18:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正他不是这么跟我说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not that he's told me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.68,0:18:36.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就对你知无不言吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And he tells you everything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.40,0:18:38.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去跟弗瑞谈吧 他需要你帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Talk to Fury. He needs you on this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.20,0:18:40.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要把我关起来吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He needs me in a cage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.32,0:18:41.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会把你关起…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No one's going to put you in a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.44,0:18:42.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少骗我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop lying to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.44,0:18:48.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 没变身呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sorry. That was me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.88,0:18:51.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是想试试你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I just wanted to see what you'd do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.20,0:18:57.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱们好好说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why don't we do this the easy way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.24,0:18:58.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把枪收起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}where you don't use that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.64,0:19:02.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个家伙也不会乱来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the other guy doesn't make a mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.16,0:19:04.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.36,0:19:06.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娜塔莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Natasha?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.08,0:19:13.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stand down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.00,0:19:15.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're good here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.24,0:19:18.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这叫只有你我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Just you and me."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.80,0:19:23.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这太不像话了 局长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is out of line, Director.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.20,0:19:27.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要操控你控制不了的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're dealing with forces you can't control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.92,0:19:31.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,议员先生 你参过战 打过仗吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You ever been in a war, Councilman? In a firefight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.44,0:19:34.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战争中哪有什么完全控制可言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you feel an overabundance of control?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.32,0:19:37.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说这个阿斯加德已向地球宣战了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're saying that this Asgard is declaring war on our planet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.68,0:19:40.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是阿斯加德 只是洛基{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not Asgard. Loki.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.40,0:19:43.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他总不会孤身而战 另一个神呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He can't be working alone. What about the other one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.20,0:19:44.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他哥哥呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.32,0:19:46.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据我们的情报 托尔不是敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our intelligence says Thor is not a hostile{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.48,0:19:47.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他相距甚远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but he's worlds away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.60,0:19:49.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能指望他来帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We can't depend on him to help, either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.44,0:19:50.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全看我们的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's up to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.52,0:19:53.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你更该全力开发第二阶段{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which is why you should be focusing on Phase 2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.20,0:19:54.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它正是为这种情况…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was designed for exactly this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.64,0:19:57.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二阶段尚未完成 而敌人已磨刀霍霍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Phase 2 isn't ready. Our enemy is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.92,0:19:59.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要一支应急分队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We need a response team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.20,0:20:02.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,复仇者计划已被叫停了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Avengers Initiative was shut down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.60,0:20:04.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没说复仇者联盟的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This isn't about the Avengers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.52,0:20:05.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们看过那份名单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We've seen the list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.80,0:20:07.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你手上有世界一流的秘密特工组织{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're running the world's greatest covert security network{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.04,0:20:09.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却要把人类的命运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you're going to leave the fate of the human race{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.76,0:20:10.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给一群怪胎吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to a handful of freaks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.08,0:20:12.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我根本不是这意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not leaving anything to anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.12,0:20:15.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的确需要一支应急分队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We need a response team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.20,0:20:18.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些人或许孤僻 甚至不太正常{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These people may be isolated, unbalanced even{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.00,0:20:20.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我相信只要用人得当{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I believe with the right push{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.33,0:20:22.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们正能给我们亟需的帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they can be exactly what we need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.28,0:20:24.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You believe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.72,0:20:28.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感情用事是不能赢得战争的 局长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}War isn't won by sentiment, Director.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.84,0:20:32.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的确 但好兵能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, it's won by soldiers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.40,0:20:54.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没时间了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's not enough time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.32,0:20:55.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得让她落在海里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I got to put her in the water!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.96,0:21:01.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You won't be alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.52,0:21:03.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:05.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙还活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This guy is still alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.28,0:21:32.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失眠了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Trouble sleeping?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.24,0:21:36.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都睡了70年了 长官 我想我睡够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I slept for 70 years, sir. I think I've had my fill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.58,0:21:39.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你该出门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then you should be out,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.88,0:21:42.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庆祝一下 去看看花花世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}celebrating, seeing the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.64,0:21:50.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我落水时 世界还在打仗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When I went under, the world was at war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.56,0:21:52.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我醒来 只听人说我们赢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wake up, they say we won.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.00,0:21:54.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却没人说我们失去了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They didn't say what we lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.04,0:21:57.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些年我们犯过错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We've made some mistakes along the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.68,0:21:59.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近就犯过一些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some, very recently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.40,0:22:03.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你带了任务来吗 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you here with a mission, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.68,0:22:04.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.76,0:22:06.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想让我"重出江湖"吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Trying to get me back in the world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.84,0:22:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想让你拯救世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Trying to save it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.92,0:22:14.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海德拉的秘密武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}HYDRA's secret weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.04,0:22:17.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是霍华德·斯塔克找你的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Howard Stark fished that out of the ocean{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.16,0:22:18.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从海里捞上来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when he was looking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.76,0:22:20.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他跟我们想到了一块儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He thought what we think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.60,0:22:24.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙魔方可能是开发无限永续能源的关键{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Tesseract could be the key to unlimited sustainable energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.00,0:22:28.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这正是人类亟需的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's something the world sorely needs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.12,0:22:31.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被谁夺去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who took it from you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.44,0:22:32.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫洛基{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's called Loki.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.00,0:22:35.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他算是远道而来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's not from around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.96,0:22:39.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你加入 还有很多情况需要了解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's a lot we'll have to bring you up to speed on if you're in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.20,0:22:43.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这世界比你记忆中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The world has gotten even stranger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.28,0:22:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更奇怪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than you already know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.80,0:22:47.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在已经见怪不怪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At this point, I doubt anything would surprise me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.88,0:22:49.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我赌10块说你错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ten bucks says you're wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.16,0:22:52.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任务报告集{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's a debriefing packet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.60,0:22:54.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放在你公寓了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}waiting for you back at your apartment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.16,0:22:58.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于宇宙魔方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is there anything you can tell us about the Tesseract{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.12,0:23:00.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么我们现在需要了解的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that we ought to know now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.56,0:23:02.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就不该把它捞上来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You should have left it in the ocean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.20,0:23:38.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边准备就绪 接下来看你的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good to go on this end. The rest is up to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.16,0:23:40.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你断开输电线了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You disconnected the transmission lines?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.56,0:23:41.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们与电网断开了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are we off the grid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.64,0:23:43.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯塔克大厦即将成为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stark Tower is about to become a beacon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.88,0:23:45.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自给清洁能源的标志建筑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of self-sustaining clean energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.40,0:23:47.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果方舟反应堆能够接替发电{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, assuming the arc reactor takes over{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.48,0:23:48.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并正常运行的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and it actually works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.00,0:23:50.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I assume.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.72,0:23:51.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,点亮她吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Light her up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.03,0:23:58.20,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,(斯塔克){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.20,0:23:59.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好看吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How does it look?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.32,0:24:01.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像圣诞节 但更有我的范儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like Christmas, but with more me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.08,0:24:03.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公众意识宣传得加大力度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We've got to go wider on the public awareness campaign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.96,0:24:04.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得在媒体上造势{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You need to do some press.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.56,0:24:06.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天我去华府{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm in DC tomorrow,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.68,0:24:08.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在为另三座大厦选址{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm working on the zoning for the next three buildings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.28,0:24:10.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小辣椒 别说了 享受这一刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pepper, you're killing me. The moment, remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.60,0:24:11.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忙里偷闲得几回嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Enjoy the moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.80,0:24:12.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你进来我才有的偷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get in here and I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.12,0:24:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生 神盾局的科尔森探员来电{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir, Agent Coulson of S.H.I.E.L.D. Is on the line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.48,0:24:20.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说我在外面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.08,0:24:22.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,严格说我的确在外面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm actually out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.14,0:24:32.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生 他坚持要找您{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir, I'm afraid he's insisting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.86,0:24:35.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点骨气 贾维斯 我佳人有约{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Grow a spine, Jarvis. I got a date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.86,0:24:42.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能级稳定…吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Levels are holding steady, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.20,0:24:45.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须的 我都亲自动手了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course they are. I was directly involved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.48,0:24:46.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这正让我想到一个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which brings me to my next question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.76,0:24:48.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当天才的感觉如何{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How does it feel to be a genius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.84,0:24:50.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真逗 我等俗人哪知道您的感受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, I really wouldn't know, now would I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.20,0:24:55.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这叫什么话 这一切可都归功于你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you mean? All this came from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.72,0:24:59.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 这一切归功于这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, all this came from that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.20,0:25:02.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的军功章也有你的一半嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give yourself some credit. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.60,0:25:04.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯塔克大厦就是你的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stark Tower is your baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.52,0:25:06.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个军功章12%是你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give yourself 12% of the credit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.24,0:25:09.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才12%{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}12%?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.44,0:25:10.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好讲讲可以说到15%{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An argument can be made for 15.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.64,0:25:12.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的孩子我只有12%的份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}12%? My baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.36,0:25:13.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟重活都是我干的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, I did do all the heavy lifting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.00,0:25:15.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都不是打比方 重物都是我搬的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Literally, I lifted the heavy things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.04,0:25:18.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再者 安保混乱的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And, sorry, but the security snafu?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.32,0:25:19.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你的错吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That was on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.88,0:25:21.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我私人电梯的事 - 你是说我们的电梯吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- My private elevator... - You mean our elevator?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.08,0:25:24.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挤了一堆一身臭汗的工人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}...it was teeming with sweaty workmen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.84,0:25:27.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你待会儿会为我分军功章的那一席话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm going to pay for that comment about percentages{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.28,0:25:29.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而温柔地掐死我 是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in some subtle way later, aren't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.60,0:25:30.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会很温柔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not going to be that subtle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.96,0:25:32.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll tell you what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.20,0:25:35.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一栋大厦会挂上"波茨"的大名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The next building is gonna say "Potts" On the tower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.76,0:25:37.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挂在租契上吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On the lease.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.96,0:25:39.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打电话问问你妈能不能留下来过夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Call your mom. Can you bunk over?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.20,0:25:41.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生 您的电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir, the telephone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.60,0:25:43.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的规程被人改写了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm afraid my protocols are being overridden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.08,0:25:45.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯塔克 我有急事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr Stark, we need to talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.24,0:25:48.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是托尼·斯塔克的活体假人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have reached the life model decoy of Tony Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.72,0:25:50.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 请留言 - 是急事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Please leave a message. - This is urgent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.80,0:25:52.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就说快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then leave it urgently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.20,0:25:55.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安全漏洞 你的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Security breach. It's on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.48,0:25:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 斯塔克先生 - 菲尔 快进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Mr Stark. - Phil! Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.24,0:25:59.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫这么亲热干嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Phil"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.12,0:26:01.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能久留{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.32,0:26:02.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他名叫"探员"啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His first name is "Agent."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.68,0:26:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进来吧 我们正在庆祝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on in. We're celebrating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.44,0:26:06.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他不能久留{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which is why he can't stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.36,0:26:08.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得看完这些资料 越快越好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We need you to look this over as soon as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.44,0:26:09.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不喜欢别人递给我东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't like being handed things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.64,0:26:11.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事 我就喜欢别人递给我东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's fine, because I love to be handed things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.24,0:26:12.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱们换换吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, let's trade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.84,0:26:15.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.20,0:26:20.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正式咨询时间为每隔一周的周四8点到17点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Official consulting hours are between 8 and 5 every other Thursday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.56,0:26:21.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是咨询{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This isn't a consultation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.64,0:26:22.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是关于复仇者联盟吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is this about the Avengers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.24,0:26:24.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对那个可一无所知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which I know nothing about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.20,0:26:27.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,复仇者计划不是被弃了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Avengers Initiative was scrapped, I thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.84,0:26:29.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再说我都不够格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I didn't even qualify.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.36,0:26:30.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这我也不知情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I didn't know that either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.48,0:26:33.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的 人家嫌我反覆无常 自我为中心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apparently I'm volatile, self-obsessed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.20,0:26:35.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有团队精神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}don't play well with others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.68,0:26:36.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这我还真知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That I did know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.76,0:26:38.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在管不了性格如何了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This isn't about personality profiles any more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.48,0:26:40.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便了 波茨小姐 能过来一下吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever. Ms Potts, got a second?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.92,0:26:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Half a mo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.96,0:26:49.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为我们俩能浪漫一会儿呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, I thought we were having a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.40,0:26:50.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只能享受12%的浪漫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was having 12% of a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.50,0:26:54.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像不是闹着玩的 菲尔似乎余惊未消{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This seems serious. Phil's pretty shaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.06,0:26:56.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道 你干嘛喊他菲尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How would you know if it's... Why is he "Phil"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.14,0:26:58.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这都是什么啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.02,0:27:00.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.18,0:27:02.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己瞧吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.20,0:27:11.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今晚就飞去华府{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm going to take the jet to DC tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.64,0:27:12.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.76,0:27:14.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有资料要看 而且不少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have homework. You have a lot of homework.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.16,0:27:16.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是没有呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, what if I didn't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.40,0:27:18.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- If you didn't? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.92,0:27:20.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说等你看完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You mean when you've finished?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.04,0:27:25.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, then...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.20,0:27:32.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说定了 旅途顺利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Square deal. Fly safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.48,0:27:37.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Work hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.32,0:27:41.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你路过拉加迪亚机场吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, any chance you're driving by LaGuardia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.20,0:27:44.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我捎你一程吧 - 太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I can drop you. - Fantastic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.36,0:27:47.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我说说那个大提琴手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want to hear about the cellist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.45,0:27:48.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们还在约会吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that still a thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.39,0:27:48.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她回波特兰了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She moved back to Portland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.12,0:27:52.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What? Boo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.20,0:28:02.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们离总部还有约四十分钟航程 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're about 40 minutes out from home base, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.20,0:28:09.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,班纳博士想复制用在我身上的血清吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, this Dr Banner was trying to replicate the serum they used on me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.22,0:28:11.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多人都试过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A lot of people were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.20,0:28:13.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是史上首个超级英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were the world's first superhero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.75,0:28:16.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,班纳以为伽马射线可能是破解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Banner thought gamma radiation might hold the key{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.76,0:28:18.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厄斯金原始配方的关键{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to unlocking Erskine's original formula.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.28,0:28:21.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜事与愿违{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Didn't really go his way, did it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.00,0:28:23.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.00,0:28:24.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过他正常的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When he's not that thing, though,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.95,0:28:26.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像史蒂芬·霍金{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the guy's like a Stephen Hawking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.28,0:28:30.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个很天才的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's like a smart person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.76,0:28:33.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I gotta say,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.16,0:28:36.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能正式跟你见面是我的荣幸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's an honour to meet you officially.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.20,0:28:38.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我之前其实见过你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've sort of met you. I mean,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.80,0:28:40.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你昏睡时我去看过你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I watched you while you were sleeping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.28,0:28:44.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说 你在冰里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, I was present{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.60,0:28:47.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昏迷不醒时 我也在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}while you were unconscious from the ice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.20,0:28:51.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说真的 这真是…你能加入{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, it's really just a huge honour{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.52,0:28:53.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是莫大的荣幸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to have you on board this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.76,0:28:55.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望我能胜任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hope I'm the man for the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.76,0:28:58.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定胜任 毫无疑问{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, you are. Absolutely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.72,0:29:01.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们对你的制服做了些修改{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We made some modifications to the uniform.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.68,0:29:03.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还提出了设计意见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had a little design input.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.32,0:29:04.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的制服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The uniform?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.20,0:29:07.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星条的样式不会…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Aren't the stars and stripes a little{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.72,0:29:09.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太过时了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}old-fashioned?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.80,0:29:12.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,考虑到眼下的局势{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With everything that's happening{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.08,0:29:14.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和即将到来的恶战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the things that are about to come to light,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.48,0:29:18.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们或许正需要点过去的精神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}people might just need a little old-fashioned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.20,0:29:55.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,齐塔瑞人越来越耐不住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Chitauri grow restless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.24,0:29:56.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫他们严阵以待{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let them gird themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.00,0:29:58.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我将领导他们发动一场光荣的战役{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will lead them in the glorious battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.92,0:30:00.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战役{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Battle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.84,0:30:03.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就对付地球上羸弱的势力吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Against the meagre might of Earth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.00,0:30:06.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光荣之至 且速战速决{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Glorious, not lengthy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.92,0:30:10.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前提是你的大军如你说的那般所向披靡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If your force is as formidable as you claim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.76,0:30:13.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你竟敢质疑我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You question us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.36,0:30:15.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,质疑他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You question him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.56,0:30:17.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别忘了是他把权杖交给了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he who put the sceptre in your hand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.20,0:30:20.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还传授你远古知识 给你新的使命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who gave you ancient knowledge and new purpose{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.20,0:30:23.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然你遭到流放 一败涂地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when you were cast out, defeated?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.16,0:30:25.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是阿斯加德之王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was a king!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.16,0:30:28.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王位本该属于我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The rightful king of Asgard,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.20,0:30:30.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无奈遭人背叛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}betrayed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.80,0:30:33.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这是器小志近{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your ambition is little{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.52,0:30:36.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,满心幼稚的念想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and born of childish need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.20,0:30:39.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我们则放眼地球之外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We look beyond the Earth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.32,0:30:42.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些将被宇宙魔方开启的更广博的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to the greater worlds the Tesseract will unveil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.60,0:30:43.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别忘了魔方还在我这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't have the Tesseract yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.20,0:30:48.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有威胁你的意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't threaten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.64,0:30:52.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但只要传送门尚未打开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But until I open the doors,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.32,0:30:55.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的军队还非由我统领{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until your force is mine to command,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.52,0:30:58.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也只是空谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you are but words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.44,0:31:02.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯加德人 你去发动战争吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will have your war, Asgardian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.20,0:31:06.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可如果你战败{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you fail,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.08,0:31:11.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果宇宙魔方落入他人之手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if the Tesseract is kept from us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.48,0:31:15.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论你躲到什么地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there will be no realm, no barren moon,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.20,0:31:19.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也会把你找出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}no crevice where he cannot find you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.20,0:31:23.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自以为了解痛苦的滋味吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You think you know pain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.04,0:31:29.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他给你的折磨 会让你渴望痛苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will make you long for something sweet as pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.28,0:32:00.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去拿队长的行头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stow the captain's gear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.40,0:32:01.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.84,0:32:05.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗曼诺夫探员 这位是罗杰斯队长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Agent Romanoff, Captain Rogers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.04,0:32:07.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 女士 你好 - 你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Ma'am. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.44,0:32:08.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舰桥那边找你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They need you on the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.52,0:32:09.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们开始面部识别追踪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're starting the face-trace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.16,0:32:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待会见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.28,0:32:17.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在冰层中找到你的事引起了不小的轰动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was quite the buzz around here, finding you in the ice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.52,0:32:19.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为科尔森会乐晕呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought Coulson was gonna swoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.20,0:32:22.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他求你给他的美国队长收藏卡签名了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did he ask you to sign his Captain America trading cards yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.26,0:32:25.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收藏卡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Trading cards?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.62,0:32:27.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝版珍藏呢 他很以为傲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're vintage. He's very proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.38,0:32:30.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,班纳博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dr Banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.54,0:32:33.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.30,0:32:35.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听说你要来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They told me you would be coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.66,0:32:36.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听说你能找到魔方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Word is, you can find the Cube.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.90,0:32:39.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没听到别的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that the only word on me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.10,0:32:41.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别的我都当耳边风了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only word I care about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.70,0:32:46.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定觉得这一切很奇怪吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It must be strange for you, all of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.26,0:32:49.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老实说 我倒有种久违之感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, this is actually kind of familiar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.02,0:32:52.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二位还是快进去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gentlemen, you might want to step inside in a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.70,0:32:55.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里待会就难以呼吸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's going to get a little hard to breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.54,0:32:58.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空勤人员 清空甲板{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Flight crew, secure the deck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.24,0:33:04.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是潜艇吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is this a submarine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.28,0:33:06.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.36,0:33:09.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我待在水下密闭加压的金属罐里吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They want me in a submerged, pressurised, metal container?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.28,0:33:38.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 这个更糟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no, this is much worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.16,0:34:09.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盘旋动力检查完毕 位置稳定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hover power check complete. Position cyclic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.96,0:34:12.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动力增大至8%{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Increase collective to 8.0%.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.16,0:34:19.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备全速起航{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Preparing for maximum performance takeoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.48,0:34:20.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将输出升到最高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Increase output to capacity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.08,0:34:23.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全速模式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Power plant performing at capacity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.32,0:34:27.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备就绪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.92,0:34:29.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎全部开启{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All engines operating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.56,0:34:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,施行神盾局193.6号紧急协议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}S.H.I.E.L.D. Emergency Protocol 193.6 in effect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.24,0:34:36.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 航母已达预定高度 长官 - 很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- We are at level, sir. - Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.04,0:34:37.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们消失吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's vanish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.20,0:34:40.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开启反光板{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Engage retro-reflection panels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.64,0:34:56.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反光板已开启{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Reflection panels engaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.26,0:34:59.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.42,0:35:12.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你能来 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doctor, thank you for coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.42,0:35:16.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们没动粗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thanks for asking nicely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.42,0:35:18.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要在这里待多长久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, how long am I staying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.14,0:35:20.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一拿到宇宙魔方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Once we get our hands on the Tesseract,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.98,0:35:23.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会让你走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you're in the wind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.26,0:35:25.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们进展如何{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where are you with that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.22,0:35:26.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在扫描全球所有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're sweeping every wirelessly accessible{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.02,0:35:27.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可无线读取的摄像头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}camera on the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.54,0:35:30.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手机 笔记本{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cell phones, laptops...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.78,0:35:33.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要连接了卫星 就是我们的眼线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If it's connected to a satellite, it's eyes and ears for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.14,0:35:35.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么找还是来不及{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's still not gonna find them in time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.54,0:35:36.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们得缩小范围{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have to narrow your field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.70,0:35:38.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能调用多少台光谱仪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How many spectrometers do you have access to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.91,0:35:39.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要多少有多少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How many are there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.70,0:35:40.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,联系所有你找得到的实验室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Call every lab you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.28,0:35:42.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫他们把光谱仪放在房顶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell them to put the spectrometers on the roof{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.80,0:35:44.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,校准搜索伽马射线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and calibrate them for gamma rays.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.40,0:35:47.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会根据聚类识别草拟出跟踪算法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll rough out a tracking algorithm, basic cluster recognition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.76,0:35:50.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起码能排除几个区域{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At least we could rule out a few places.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.32,0:35:52.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能给我找个干活的地方吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you have somewhere for me to work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.28,0:35:53.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗曼诺夫探员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Agent Romanoff,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.52,0:35:55.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦你带班纳博士去他的实验室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}could you show Dr. Banner to his laboratory, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.26,0:35:59.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里一应俱全 包您满意 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're gonna love it, Doc. We got all the toys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.94,0:36:01.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放到那边去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Put it over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.58,0:36:05.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些人你从哪找来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where did you find all these people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.82,0:36:08.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神盾局从不缺敌人 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}S.H.I.E.L.D. has no shortage of enemies, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.20,0:36:10.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要的是这个吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is this the stuff you need?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.23,0:36:11.20,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,(海因里希·赛弗博士){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.20,0:36:12.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铱 就是它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, iridium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.32,0:36:14.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陨石里有 能形成反质子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's found in meteorites. It forms anti-protons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.04,0:36:16.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这东西很难找{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's very hard to get hold of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.80,0:36:18.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是神盾局知道你需要它就更难找了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Especially if S.H.I.E.L.D. knows you need it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.28,0:36:20.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这我都没想到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, I didn't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.16,0:36:24.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙魔方让我看到了太多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Tesseract has shown me so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.80,0:36:26.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经超越了知识 而是真理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's more than knowledge. It's truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.76,0:36:27.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.52,0:36:30.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴顿探员 它给你看了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What did it show you, Agent Barton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.28,0:36:32.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我下个目标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My next target.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.80,0:36:33.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me what you need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.12,0:36:38.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一场混乱 分散注意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need a distraction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.76,0:36:41.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和一颗眼珠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And an eyeball.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.20,0:36:50.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个…太麻烦就算了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, if it's not too much trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.84,0:36:51.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里 不麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no. It's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.76,0:36:56.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是绝版套牌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a vintage set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.48,0:36:58.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找了几年才集齐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It took me a couple of years to collect them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.22,0:37:03.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还很新呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Near mint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.46,0:37:04.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,边角有点泛黄 但…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Slight foxing around the edges, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.98,0:37:07.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有发现 面部特征67%吻合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We got a hit. A 67% match.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.98,0:37:09.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 交叉比对显示79%吻合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait. Cross match, 79%.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.50,0:37:11.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Location?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.62,0:37:14.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,德国斯图加特 库宁大街28号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stuttgart, Germany. 28, Canning Strasse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.74,0:37:15.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就没有躲起来的意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's not exactly hiding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.14,0:37:17.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Captain,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.54,0:37:18.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you're up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.26,0:39:11.60,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,(视网膜扫描 身份识别 海因里希·赛弗博士 开锁){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.26,0:39:55.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我下跪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kneel before me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.62,0:40:00.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聋了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I said{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.86,0:40:04.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下跪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}kneel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.86,0:40:17.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样多好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is not this simpler?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.28,0:40:22.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回归你们本来的状态{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is this not your natural state?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.56,0:40:27.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人之初 性本奴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's the unspoken truth of humanity,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.84,0:40:30.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是没人说穿罢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that you crave subjugation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.06,0:40:32.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自由看似光鲜 诱惑着你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The bright lure of freedom{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.87,0:40:37.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去疯抢权力 去寻求个性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}diminishes your life's joy in a mad scramble for power,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.22,0:40:41.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实夺去了人生的乐趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for identity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.84,0:40:46.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们天生就该受人统治{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were made to be ruled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.64,0:40:48.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到头来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the end,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.44,0:40:50.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们总会俯首称臣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you will always kneel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.72,0:40:59.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会向你这样的人称臣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not to men like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.60,0:41:02.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你再找不出我这样的人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are no men like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.28,0:41:07.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这样的疯子层出不穷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are always men like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.28,0:41:10.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 瞧瞧这个老头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look to your elder, people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.16,0:41:13.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就用他 杀一儆百{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let him be an example.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.04,0:41:22.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗 我上次来德国时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, the last time I was in Germany,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.72,0:41:25.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也遇到一个将别人踩在脚下的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and saw a man standing above everybody else,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.96,0:41:27.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们闹掰了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we ended up disagreeing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.26,0:41:30.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是美国大兵啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.10,0:41:33.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被时间甩在后面的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The man out of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.86,0:41:35.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少我还有时间 你则大限将至{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not the one who's out of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.22,0:41:41.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛基 放下武器 马上投降{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Loki, drop the weapon and stand down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.18,0:42:02.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下跪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kneel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.22,0:42:04.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not today!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.58,0:42:07.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到处都是他的分身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The guy's all over the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.28,0:42:14.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗曼诺夫探员 想我没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Agent Romanoff. You miss me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.00,0:42:15.96,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,(广播系统被改写){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.70,0:42:32.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出招啊 小鹿斑比{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make your move, Reindeer Games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.99,0:42:41.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这才乖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.23,0:42:45.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.11,0:42:47.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.15,0:42:55.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他开口了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is he saying anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.91,0:42:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一言未发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not a word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.39,0:42:59.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带回来再说 时间不多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just get him here. We're low on time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.25,0:43:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有不好的感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.57,0:43:06.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摇滚明星乖乖投降有什么不好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What? Rock of Ages giving up so easily?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.65,0:43:08.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可是抵抗了好一番{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't remember it being that easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.41,0:43:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙挺能打的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This guy packs a wallop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.01,0:43:13.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎样 你一把年纪 身手还蛮敏捷的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Still, you are pretty spry for an older fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.45,0:43:15.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做什么锻炼 普拉提吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's your thing, Pilates?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.13,0:43:17.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.25,0:43:18.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟健美操差不多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's like calisthenics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.33,0:43:20.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些事你可能不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You might have missed a couple of things{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.49,0:43:22.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟做了那么久的美队棒棒冰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}doing time as a Capsicle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.29,0:43:25.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗瑞没说他也找你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fury didn't tell me he was calling you in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.01,0:43:28.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 弗瑞没说的事多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, there's a lot of things Fury doesn't tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.13,0:43:30.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎么打起闪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where's this coming from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.57,0:43:37.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干嘛 打个闪你也怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's the matter? Are you scared of a little lightning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.45,0:43:39.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是不喜欢紧随闪电而来的家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not overly fond of what follows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.22,0:43:59.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要干嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.25,0:44:13.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又来个添乱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now there's that guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.85,0:44:15.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也是阿斯加德的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Another Asgardian?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.73,0:44:17.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你说他是我们这边的吗 - 无所谓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- That guy's a friendly? - Doesn't matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.69,0:44:19.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要是放了洛基或杀了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If he frees Loki or kills him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.43,0:44:20.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙魔方都找不回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Tesseract's lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.67,0:44:22.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯塔克 我们需要出击计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stark, we need a plan of attack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.82,0:44:24.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有计划 出击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a plan. Attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.29,0:44:33.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别去搅这浑水了 队长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd sit this one out, Cap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.21,0:44:34.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这我做不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't see how I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.37,0:44:36.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都是传说啊 差不多就是神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These guys come from legend. They're basically gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.33,0:44:38.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神只有上帝一个 女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's only one God, ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.69,0:44:40.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且他肯定不会穿成那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I'm pretty sure he doesn't dress like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.21,0:44:57.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙魔方在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is the Tesseract?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.23,0:44:59.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I missed you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.67,0:45:01.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我像是有心情跟你闹着玩吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do I look to be in a gaming mood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.95,0:45:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该谢我才是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You should thank me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.71,0:45:06.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彩虹桥已毁 众神之父聚集了多少暗能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With the Bifrost gone, how much dark energy did the Allfather have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.08,0:45:08.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才将你传送到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to muster to conjure you here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.71,0:45:10.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的宝贝地球来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to your precious Earth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.99,0:45:15.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为你死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought you dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.79,0:45:18.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为我哀悼了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you mourn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.29,0:45:21.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都哀悼了 我们的父王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We all did. Our father...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.33,0:45:24.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你的父王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.93,0:45:28.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把我的身世告诉你了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He did tell you my true parentage, did he not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.13,0:45:33.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们从小一起长大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We were raised together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.29,0:45:36.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起玩 一起打{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We played together, we fought together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.29,0:45:38.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不记得了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you remember none of that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.65,0:45:40.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只记得一道阴影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I remember a shadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.97,0:45:44.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的威武投下的阴影一直笼罩着我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Living in the shade of your greatness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.57,0:45:48.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只记得你将我扔下深渊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I remember you tossing me into an abyss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.21,0:45:51.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是国王 王位本该是我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I, who was, and should be, king!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.33,0:45:53.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就祸害我珍视的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So you take the world I love as a recompense{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.45,0:45:55.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来补偿你臆想出的轻慢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for your imagined slights?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.41,0:45:58.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没门 我会保护地球 洛基{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. The Earth is under my protection, Loki.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.73,0:46:03.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧你保护得多好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you're doing a marvellous job with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.57,0:46:05.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类成群地相互残杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The humans slaughter each other in droves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.57,0:46:07.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你却傻在一边干着急{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}while you idly fret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.49,0:46:09.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想统治他们 这有何不可{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean to rule them, as why should I not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.77,0:46:11.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自以为高他们一等吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You think yourself above them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.29,0:46:13.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.45,0:46:15.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就没领会统治的真谛 弟弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then you miss the truth of ruling, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.21,0:46:18.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不适合做国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A throne would suit you ill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.53,0:46:26.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我见过你所不知的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've seen worlds you've never known about!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.37,0:46:30.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奥丁之子 流放的日子里 我长了见识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have grown, Odinson, in my exile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.73,0:46:33.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我见识过宇宙魔方的真正力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have seen the true power of the Tesseract,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.23,0:46:35.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我控制它时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and when I wield it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.47,0:46:37.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁向你展示了它的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who showed you this power?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.27,0:46:39.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这自封之王听命于谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who controls the would-be king?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.75,0:46:41.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我本就是国王 - 在这儿不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I am a king! - Not here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.67,0:46:42.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交出宇宙魔方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You give up the Tesseract!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.03,0:46:45.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放下这恶毒的野心吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You give up this poisonous dream!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.07,0:46:49.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟哥回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You come home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.15,0:46:55.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔方不在我手上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.23,0:46:58.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有它你不能带我回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You need the Cube to bring me home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.07,0:47:01.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我把它转移了 我也不知移到了哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I've sent it off, I know not where.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.39,0:47:04.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给哥听着 弟弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You listen well, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.03,0:47:07.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小弟听着呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm listening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.25,0:47:18.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再动我要你好看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not touch me again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.25,0:47:20.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你也别动我的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then don't take my stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.97,0:47:23.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别这么不知深浅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have no idea what you're dealing with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.93,0:47:27.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是莎翁戏剧的公园公演吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shakespeare in the Park?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.21,0:47:30.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"尔取帘为披风 汝母安知"（莎翁戏剧词）{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Doth Mother know you wear-eth her drapes?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.45,0:47:33.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这事你管不了 铁人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is beyond you, metal man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.29,0:47:35.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛基会依阿斯加德的法律受到制裁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Loki will face Asgardian justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.53,0:47:38.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要他交出魔方 你就可以带他回家 否则{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He gives up the Cube, he's all yours. Until then,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.13,0:47:40.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好狗不挡道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}stay out of the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.21,0:47:43.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你个观光客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tourist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.93,0:47:49.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你狠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.29,0:48:23.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电能达到400%{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Power at 400% capacity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.29,0:48:24.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个可以有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.21,0:49:30.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你俩够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.09,0:49:35.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你想干嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, I don't know what you plan on doing here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.93,0:49:38.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是来粉碎洛基的阴谋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've come here to put an end to Loki's schemes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.33,0:49:40.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用行动说话 把锤子放下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then prove it. Put that hammer down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.89,0:49:41.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah... No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.09,0:49:43.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坏主意 他爱死他的锤子了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bad call. He loves his hammer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.01,0:49:47.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要我放下锤子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You want me to put the hammer down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.21,0:50:16.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打够了没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are we done, here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.23,0:51:07.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丑话说前面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In case it's unclear,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.75,0:51:09.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试图逃跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if you try to escape,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.51,0:51:12.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者哪怕挠那玻璃一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if you so much as scratch that glass,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.21,0:51:26.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就会跟着这牢笼坠落九千米的高空{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's 30,000 feet straight down in a steel trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.53,0:51:29.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听懂了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You get how that works?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.53,0:51:34.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尔为蚂蚁 爷为靴子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ant, boot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.25,0:51:38.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这笼子真不赖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's an impressive cage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.81,0:51:42.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜不是为我造的吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not built, I think, for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.69,0:51:44.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是为比你还厉害的东西建的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Built for something a lot stronger than you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.21,0:51:47.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有所耳闻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, I've heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.27,0:51:50.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明是愚蠢的野兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A mindless beast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.35,0:51:52.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却装作自己还是常人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Makes play he's still a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.95,0:51:56.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这是多慌不择路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How desperate are you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.31,0:51:59.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这样的怪兽也当做救兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that you call on such lost creatures to defend you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.47,0:52:01.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慌不择路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How desperate am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.91,0:52:03.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你威胁说要向我的世界开战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You threaten my world with war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.83,0:52:05.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你偷了你无法掌控的能量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You steal a force you can't hope to control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.07,0:52:09.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘴上说什么安宁 却以杀戮为乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You talk about peace, and you kill because it's fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.91,0:52:12.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已逼得我不择手段{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have made me very desperate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.29,0:52:15.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你会吃不了兜着走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You might not be glad that you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.25,0:52:21.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,功败垂成让你痛苦万分吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It burns you to have come so close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.21,0:52:25.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿到了宇宙魔方 拥有其能量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To have the Tesseract, to have power,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.57,0:52:28.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是无限的能量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}unlimited power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.89,0:52:30.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你却用来做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.37,0:52:36.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,点一盏明灯 照亮全人类吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A warm light for all mankind to share.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.25,0:52:40.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后才领教到真正力量的厉害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then to be reminded what real power is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.29,0:52:48.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正力量要是想看杂志了跟我说一声{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, let me know if "Real power" wants a magazine or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.21,0:52:58.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是越看越讨人喜欢的娃啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He really grows on you, doesn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.81,0:53:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛基是在拖延时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Loki's gonna drag this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.85,0:53:04.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尔 他到底打的什么算盘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, Thor, what's his play?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.37,0:53:06.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有一支齐塔瑞人的大军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has an army called the Chitauri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.01,0:53:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁都不知道他们的来头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're not of Asgard, nor any world known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.21,0:53:12.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他打算领着这支大军侵略你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He means to lead them against your people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.21,0:53:14.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会助他夺取地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They will win him the Earth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.85,0:53:16.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜 作为交换 他要交出宇宙魔方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in return, I suspect, for the Tesseract.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.77,0:53:18.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An army{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.65,0:53:20.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是外太空的大军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from outer space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.45,0:53:22.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那他还得建一个传送门啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, he's building another portal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.97,0:53:24.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他掳走艾瑞克·塞尔维格就是为这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's what he needs Erik Selvig for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.37,0:53:25.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塞尔维格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Selvig?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.49,0:53:27.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他是个天体物理学家 - 我们认识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- He's an astrophysicist. - He's a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.93,0:53:29.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛基不知怎么控制了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Loki has him under some kind of spell,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.23,0:53:32.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有我们一个探员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}along with one of ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.87,0:53:34.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想知道洛基怎么会甘愿束手就擒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want to know why Loki let us take him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.51,0:53:35.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他困在这儿又没法指挥大军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's not leading an army from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.95,0:53:37.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得我们不该一心想着洛基{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't think we should be focusing on Loki.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.79,0:53:39.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙就是个疯子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That guy's brain is a bag full of cats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.63,0:53:40.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一眼就能看出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You could smell crazy on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.07,0:53:42.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说话注意点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have care how you speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.27,0:53:45.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛基再怎么蛮横无理 也是我们阿斯加德的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Loki is beyond reason, but he is of Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.79,0:53:46.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是我弟弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And he is my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.03,0:53:48.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他两天内杀了八十人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He killed 80 people in two days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.67,0:53:50.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是领养的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's adopted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.79,0:53:52.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该往机械方面想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think it's about the mechanics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.19,0:53:56.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 铱 他们为什么要窃取铱 - 铱可用作稳定剂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Iridium... What do they need the iridium for? - It's a stabilising agent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.27,0:53:56.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.39,0:53:57.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便哪个周末{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm just saying, pick a weekend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.75,0:53:59.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我飞你去波特兰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll fly you to Portland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.43,0:54:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得保持浓情蜜意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Keep love alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.11,0:54:02.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能防止传送门出现自我坍圮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It means the portal won't collapse on itself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.07,0:54:04.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像之前在神盾局那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}like it did at S.H.I.E.L.D.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.23,0:54:09.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别记仇 大块头 你那两下真够劲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No hard feelings, Point Break. You've got a mean swing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.59,0:54:11.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还能让洛基随心所欲地扩展传送门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Also, it means the portal can open as wide{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.95,0:54:14.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并开放很长时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and stay open as long, as Loki wants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.95,0:54:17.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,升起后桅 调转顶帆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Raise the mizzenmast. Jib the topsails.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.71,0:54:19.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个人在玩小蜜蜂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That man is playing Galaga.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.87,0:54:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自以为别人看不到 但是我看到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He thought we wouldn't notice, but we did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.29,0:54:27.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗瑞怎么能看到两边的屏幕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How does Fury even see these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.77,0:54:28.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转身看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He turns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.01,0:54:30.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听上去真累人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sounds exhausting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.61,0:54:32.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他原材料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The rest of the raw materials,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.93,0:54:35.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴顿探员都能轻松地弄到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Agent Barton can get his hands on pretty easily.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.08,0:54:38.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他只缺一个主部件 就是能源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The only major component he still needs is a power source{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.32,0:54:40.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,某种高密度能量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of high-energy density.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.89,0:54:44.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以激活魔方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Something to kick-start the Cube.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.21,0:54:48.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么时候对热核天体物理学这么有研究{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When did you become an expert in thermonuclear astrophysics?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.25,0:54:49.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就昨晚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.69,0:54:51.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,资料集 塞尔维格的笔记{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The packet, Selvig's notes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.47,0:54:53.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些萃取论的论文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the extraction theory papers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.14,0:54:54.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都没看吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Am I the only one who did the reading?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.56,0:54:56.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛基需要什么特定的能源吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does Loki need any particular kind of power source?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.97,0:54:59.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他得将魔方加热到一亿多度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He would have to heat the Cube to 120-million Kelvin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.77,0:55:01.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才能超过库仑势垒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}just to break through the Coulomb barrier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.27,0:55:04.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非 塞尔维格已经想出{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unless Selvig has figured out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.18,0:55:06.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稳定量子隧穿效应的方法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}how to stabilise the quantum tunnelling effect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.10,0:55:06.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要是真想出来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, if he could do that,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.99,0:55:09.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能用任何一个反应堆完成重离子束聚变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he could achieve heavy ion fusion at any reactor on the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.55,0:55:11.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于有个说人话的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Finally, someone who speaks English.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.07,0:55:13.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你管这叫人话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that what just happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.15,0:55:16.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸会 班纳博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's good to meet you, Dr Banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.27,0:55:19.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对反电子碰撞的研究真是无与伦比{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your work on antielectron collisions is unparalleled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.39,0:55:21.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我觉得你失去控制{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I'm a huge fan of the way you lose control{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.31,0:55:23.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就变身狂暴绿巨人的样子超赞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and turn into an enormous green rage-monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.25,0:55:26.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夸奖了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.45,0:55:28.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,班纳博士此行只为追踪魔方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dr Banner is only here to track the Cube.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.05,0:55:30.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你能跟他一起找{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was hoping you might join him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.49,0:55:31.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从他的权杖入手吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would start with that stick of his.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.73,0:55:32.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管有没有魔力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It may be magical,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.85,0:55:34.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它的运作方式很像海德拉的武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but it works an awful lot like a Hydra weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.21,0:55:38.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海德拉我不了解 但权杖的确由魔方驱动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know about that, but it is powered by the Cube.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.58,0:55:39.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还想知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I would like to know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.68,0:55:41.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是怎么把我见过的最机警的两个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}how Loki used it to turn two of the sharpest men I know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.93,0:55:43.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成了洛基的飞猴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}into his personal flying monkeys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.01,0:55:45.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么飞猴（飞猴出自《绿野仙踪》）{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Monkeys? I do not understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.61,0:55:46.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.45,0:55:51.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道这个典故{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I understood that reference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.13,0:55:53.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们开工吧 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shall we play, Doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.61,0:55:55.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边请{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This way, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.21,0:56:12.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伽马读数跟塞尔维格的宇宙魔方报告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gamma readings are definitely consistent with{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.13,0:56:13.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是相符的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Selvig's reports of the Tesseract.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.95,0:56:15.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但处理数据要耗时数周{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But it's going to take weeks to process.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.71,0:56:16.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们绕过他们的主机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If we bypass their mainframe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.99,0:56:18.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直接上连主集群{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and direct route to the Homer cluster,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.43,0:56:21.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,速度可达每秒六百万亿次浮点运算{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we can clock this at around 600 teraflops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.51,0:56:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可就带了个牙刷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All I packed was a toothbrush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.43,0:56:26.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你哪天该来斯塔克大厦玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, you should come by Stark Tower sometime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.15,0:56:29.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上数十层是研究开发部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Top ten floors, all R&D.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.23,0:56:31.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定对你胃口 简直是糖果乐园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'd love it. It's Candy Land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.83,0:56:34.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,客气 不过我上次去纽约时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thanks, but the last time I was in New York,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.43,0:56:36.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把哈莱姆区给砸了（哈莱姆是纽约黑人区 出自《无敌浩克》）{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I kind of broke Harlem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.07,0:56:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保证给你零压力环境{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, I promise a stress-free environment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.03,0:56:40.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气氛缓和 绝不吓唬你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No tension, no surprises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.19,0:56:43.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这都不变身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.83,0:56:44.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有病啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you nuts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.91,0:56:45.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难说啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jury's out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.29,0:56:47.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还真能压得住火气啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You really have got a lid on it, haven't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.49,0:56:48.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说说诀窍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's your secret?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.57,0:56:49.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舒缓爵士乐 邦哥鼓 还是抽一大袋大麻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mellow jazz, bongo drums, huge bag of weed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.13,0:56:51.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么事都不当真吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is everything a joke to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.49,0:56:52.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好笑的不当真{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Funny things are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.57,0:56:55.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,威胁航母上所有人的生命安全并不好笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Threatening the safety of everyone on this ship isn't funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.69,0:56:56.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士 别介意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No offence, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.77,0:56:57.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's all right,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.66,0:57:01.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要是挨点扎就爆发也不会来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wouldn't have come aboard if I couldn't handle pointy things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.27,0:57:03.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这么谨小慎微的 大个子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're tip-toeing, big man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.06,0:57:04.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该放开点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You need to strut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.87,0:57:06.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你该专心解决问题 斯塔克先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you need to focus on the problem, Mr Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.59,0:57:08.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得我没有吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you think I'm not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.15,0:57:10.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗瑞干嘛现在找我们来 之前干嘛去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why did Fury call us in? Why now? Why not before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.95,0:57:12.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他对我们隐瞒了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What isn't he telling us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.75,0:57:14.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信息不全 我就无法解答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't do the equation unless I have all the variables.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.03,0:57:16.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说弗瑞有秘密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You think Fury's hiding something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.35,0:57:19.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他可是间谍 - 队长啊 他可是谍中谍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- He's a spy. - Captain, he's "The" Spy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.51,0:57:21.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的秘密会下崽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His secrets have secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.31,0:57:22.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士也纠结这事呢 是不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's bugging him, too. Isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.23,0:57:27.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想完成手头的工作...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I just want to finish my work here, and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.07,0:57:29.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有话直说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.23,0:57:36.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,点亮明灯 照亮全人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"A warm light for all mankind."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.63,0:57:38.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于魔方 洛基挖苦弗瑞的那句话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Loki's jab at Fury about the Cube.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.75,0:57:40.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也听到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I heard it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.27,0:57:42.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为他是说给你听的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think that was meant for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.15,0:57:45.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是巴顿没说 关于大厦的报道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even if Barton didn't tell Loki about the tower,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.11,0:57:47.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是铺天盖地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it was still all over the news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.80,0:57:48.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯塔克大厦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Stark Tower?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.17,0:57:52.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是纽约那座又大又丑的…建筑物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That big, ugly building in New York?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.40,0:57:55.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给大厦供能的方舟反应堆 是自给能源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's powered by an arc reactor, a self-sustaining energy source.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.08,0:57:58.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大厦一年内都不需外部能源吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That building will run itself for, what, a year?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.52,0:58:00.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还只是个雏型{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's just the prototype.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.40,0:58:02.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以说我是当今清洁能源界的独秀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm kind of the only name in clean energy right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.08,0:58:04.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是这个意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's what he's getting at.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.16,0:58:05.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那神盾局怎么不把他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, why didn't S.H.I.E.L.D.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.18,0:58:06.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,招进宇宙魔方计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bring him in on the Tesseract project?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.76,0:58:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,况且 他们当初{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are they doing in the energy business{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.56,0:58:09.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干嘛要染指能源业{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the first place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.26,0:58:14.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这的确值得调查一番 只等我的解密程序完成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I should probably look into that once my decryption programme{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.22,0:58:16.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,破解所有神盾局加密文件 我就去查{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}finishes breaking into all of S.H.I.E.L.D.'s secure files.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.42,0:58:17.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sorry. Did you say...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.50,0:58:19.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一上舰桥贾维斯就开始运行破解程序了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jarvis has been running it since I hit the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.76,0:58:20.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几小时后 我便能得知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In a few hours, I'll know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.76,0:58:22.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有神盾局想隐瞒的不可告人的秘密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}every dirty secret S.H.I.E.L.D. Has ever tried to hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.98,0:58:23.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来点蓝莓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Blueberry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.41,0:58:25.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就你这样还不明白人家干嘛不想要你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet you're confused about why they didn't want you around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.42,0:58:28.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情报部门还怕人窃取情报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An intelligence organisation that fears intelligence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.28,0:58:30.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是丢脸啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Historically, not awesome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.91,0:58:32.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看洛基就是想搞得我们草木皆兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think Loki's trying to wind us up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.82,0:58:34.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可是想发动战争的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is a man who means to start a war{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.46,0:58:35.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不专心御敌 他就会得逞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and if we don't stay focused, he'll succeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.18,0:58:39.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该服从命令听指挥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have orders. We should follow them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.02,0:58:41.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,服从命令不是我的风格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Following's not really my style.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.10,0:58:45.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,风格就是你的命根 是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you're all about style, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.50,0:58:46.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这屋里谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of the people in this room,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.62,0:58:48.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一身花里胡哨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which one is, A, wearing a spangly outfit,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.26,0:58:49.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却又一无是处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and, B, not of use?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.66,0:58:53.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史蒂夫 你真的不觉得有蹊跷吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Steve, tell me none of this smells a little funky to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.22,0:58:58.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶紧找魔方吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just find the Cube.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.22,0:59:13.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸竟对这家伙赞不绝口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's the guy my dad never shut up about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.50,0:59:16.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真该让他继续做冰棍儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm wondering if they shouldn't have kept him on ice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.98,0:59:18.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于洛基他说得对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The guy's not wrong about Loki.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.74,0:59:20.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那瘟神的确胜我们一筹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He does have the jump on us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.54,0:59:23.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛基就是有套顶级装备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What he's got is an Acme dynamite kit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.26,0:59:25.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早晚还得毁在那上面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's going to blow up in his face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.14,0:59:27.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到时候我就前排看戏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I'm going to be there when it does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.22,0:59:30.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就在家看报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah. I'll read all about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.34,0:59:33.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许你也会跟我们一起披挂上阵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or you'll be suiting up with the rest of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.10,0:59:38.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可没有铁甲护身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You see, I don't get a suit of armour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.26,0:59:42.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就那么赤膊上阵 像个疯子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm exposed. Like a nerve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.58,0:59:44.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全是场灾难{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a nightmare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.85,0:59:46.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我身体里有一堆弹片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, I've got a cluster of shrapnel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.73,0:59:49.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时刻都在往我心脏里爬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}trying every second to crawl its way into my heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.22,0:59:51.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被这个挡住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This stops it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.49,0:59:52.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个小小的光环{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This little circle of light,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.15,0:59:54.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如今它不仅是铁甲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's part of me now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.96,0:59:56.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已与我融为一体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not just armour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.94,0:59:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是种可怕的特权{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a terrible privilege.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.22,1:00:03.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 可你控制得了它 - 那是我摸索出了方法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- But you can control it. - Because I learned how.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.22,1:00:04.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.50,1:00:07.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的"意外事故"我都听说了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, I read all about your accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.82,1:00:11.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你受了那么强的伽玛辐射 死三回都够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That much gamma exposure should have killed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.14,1:00:13.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说绿巨人…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So you're saying that the Hulk...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.90,1:00:17.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个家伙救了我一命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The other guy saved my life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.66,1:00:18.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.58,1:00:23.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么想挺好 可他救我干嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a nice sentiment. Saved it for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.46,1:00:26.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许答案不久就会揭晓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I guess we'll find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.24,1:00:29.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个"答案"你未必喜欢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You may not enjoy that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.26,1:00:32.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你可能喜欢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you just might.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.29,1:00:37.12,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,(机密仓库){\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.24,1:01:33.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛基掳走了博士后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As soon as Loki took the doctor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.68,1:01:35.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们转移了简·福斯特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we moved Jane Foster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.48,1:01:37.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特罗瑟姆（挪威城市）有座很好的天文台{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They've got an excellent observatory in Troms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.88,1:01:41.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天突然有人请她去做顾问{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She was asked to consult there very suddenly yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.40,1:01:45.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,酬金不菲 搭乘私人飞机 离这儿很远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Handsome fee, private plane, very remote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.88,1:01:46.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不会有事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She'll be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.00,1:01:48.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.04,1:01:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛基抓走艾瑞克·塞尔维格绝非偶然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's no accident, Loki taking Erik Selvig.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.26,1:01:55.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怕洛基折腾够了就会害死他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I dread what he plans for him once he's done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.86,1:01:56.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾瑞克是个好人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Erik is a good man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.06,1:01:58.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他常说起你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He talks about you a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.82,1:02:01.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你改变了他的生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You changed his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.38,1:02:05.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你改变了这个世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You changed everything around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.30,1:02:07.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是以前那样好些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They were better as they were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.20,1:02:10.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在阿斯加德 我们自视高人一等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We pretend on Asgard that we're more advanced{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.32,1:02:13.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却像俾施泰姆一样来这儿胡作非为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but we come here, battling like bilge snipe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.00,1:02:15.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 像什么 - 俾施泰姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Like what? - Bilge snipe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.28,1:02:19.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那种有鳞甲和大角的巨兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, huge, scaly, big antlers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.96,1:02:21.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 地球上没有吗 - 貌似没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You don't have those? - I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.80,1:02:23.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那东西很可恶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, they are repulsive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.28,1:02:27.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,途经之地万物尽毁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And they trample everything in their path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.20,1:02:38.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我第一次来地球时 洛基的盛怒也尾随而至{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When I first came to Earth, Loki's rage followed me here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.52,1:02:40.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类为此遭受劫难{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and your people paid the price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.88,1:02:42.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在历史又重演{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now, again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.04,1:02:47.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,年轻时我好战黩武{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In my youth, I courted war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.28,1:02:52.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战斗还没打响呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}War hasn't started yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.28,1:02:54.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能从洛基口中逼问出{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You think you could make Loki tell us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.12,1:02:56.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔方的下落吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}where the Tesseract is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.48,1:02:59.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难说 洛基的心思深不可测{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not know. Loki's mind is far afield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.72,1:03:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不仅渴望权力 还想报复我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not just power he craves, it's vengeance, upon me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.36,1:03:06.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何折磨都难以撼动他的野心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's no pain would prise his need from him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.44,1:03:09.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多人都自诩是不倒泰山{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A lot of guys think that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.68,1:03:11.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是狂风刮得不够烈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until the pain starts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.22,1:03:15.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要我做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you asking me to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.78,1:03:19.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要问你 你愿意做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm asking, what are you prepared to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.34,1:03:20.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛基现在是阶下囚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Loki is a prisoner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.90,1:03:21.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我怎么会觉得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then why do I feel like{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.79,1:03:24.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有他想待在这艘航母上呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he's the only person on this boat that wants to be here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.22,1:03:40.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能偷偷接近我的人可不多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's not many people who can sneak up on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.30,1:03:41.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可你料定我会来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But you figured I'd come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.54,1:03:44.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点早了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.90,1:03:48.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为等弗瑞想不出折磨我的新招了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After whatever tortures Fury can concoct,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.30,1:03:51.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才会粉墨登场 假意友好 来安抚我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you would appear as a friend, as a balm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.74,1:03:54.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就会全盘招供了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I would cooperate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.26,1:03:57.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想知道你把巴顿探员怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want to know what you've done to Agent Barton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.30,1:03:59.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我开拓了他的心智{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would say I've expanded his mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.70,1:04:03.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你赢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And once you've won,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.38,1:04:05.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你称了王 称了霸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}once you're king of the mountain,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.66,1:04:10.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的心智会怎样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what happens to his mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.26,1:04:12.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你问这些是出于爱吗 罗曼诺夫探员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is this love, Agent Romanoff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.20,1:04:16.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小孩子才谈情说爱 我是欠他人情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Love is for children. I owe him a debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.64,1:04:22.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说来听听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.60,1:04:29.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进神盾局前 我…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Before I worked for S.H.I.E.L. D... I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.04,1:04:35.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早已声名远扬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, I made a name for myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.92,1:04:38.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会一些特定的技能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a very specific skill set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.92,1:04:42.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我黑白不分 滥杀无辜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I didn't care who I used it for, or on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.40,1:04:46.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是被神盾局盯上了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I got on S.H.I.E.L.D.'s radar in a bad way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.28,1:04:52.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们派巴顿探员来杀我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Agent Barton was sent to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.08,1:04:54.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他改了主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He made a different call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.44,1:04:59.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我保证放他一条生路 你怎么回报我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what will you do if I vow to spare him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.72,1:05:00.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会放了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not let you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.12,1:05:02.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道 可这多有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, but I like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.80,1:05:07.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整个世界都危在旦夕 你却为一个人讨价还价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your world in the balance, and you bargain for one man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.20,1:05:09.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,政权的颠覆司空见惯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Regimes fall every day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.32,1:05:11.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想为这个伤心难过 我是俄国人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I tend not to weep over that. I'm Russian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.88,1:05:12.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曾经是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.08,1:05:15.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你现在又是什么人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what are you now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.12,1:05:18.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这事很简单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's really not that complicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.08,1:05:22.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我欠了债 就要偿还{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I got red in my ledger, I'd like to wipe it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.26,1:05:26.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还债{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.02,1:05:31.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么多债 你还得清吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can you wipe out that much red?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.78,1:05:34.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,德科夫之女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dreykov's daughter,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.86,1:05:37.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣保罗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}St Paulo,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.62,1:05:41.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医院的火灾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the hospital fire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.82,1:05:44.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴顿都告诉我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Barton told me everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.22,1:05:47.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的血债罄竹难书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your ledger is dripping. It's gushing red{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.20,1:05:50.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为救一个比你强不到哪去的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you think saving a man no more virtuous than yourself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.72,1:05:52.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能改变什么吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will change anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.16,1:05:54.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是妇人之仁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is the basest sentimentality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.84,1:05:56.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像个孩子请求宽恕 真可悲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is a child at prayer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.12,1:05:58.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可悲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pathetic!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.12,1:06:01.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为骗子撒谎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You lie and kill{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.72,1:06:04.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给杀手当屠刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the service of liars and killers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.90,1:06:07.60,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,(发现病毒 非法入侵){\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.60,1:06:10.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自命不凡 装作是在以自己的准则行事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You pretend to be separate, to have your own code,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.26,1:06:13.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想以此为你所犯罪行的借口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}something that makes up for the horrors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.48,1:06:16.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那是你的一部分了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But they are part of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.92,1:06:20.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远无法抹去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And they will never go away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.22,1:06:25.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会留着巴顿 好逼他杀了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I won't touch Barton, not until I make him kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.20,1:06:27.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用他知道你最怕的手段{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Slowly, intimately,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.28,1:06:30.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点点亲手宰了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in every way he knows you fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.68,1:06:33.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这时我就唤醒他 让他有时间欣赏自己的杰作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then he'll wake just long enough to see his good work{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.76,1:06:37.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等他痛苦哀嚎之时 我再劈开他的头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and when he screams, I'll split his skull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.20,1:06:40.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我还的价 你这哭哭啼啼的婊子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is my bargain, you mewling quim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.72,1:06:43.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个禽兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're a monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.26,1:06:47.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.54,1:06:50.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你带来的那位才叫兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You brought the monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.94,1:06:54.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,班纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, Banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.46,1:06:56.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是你的计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's your play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.70,1:06:57.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.62,1:07:00.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛基想诱绿巨人变身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Loki means to unleash the Hulk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.34,1:07:01.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让班纳出实验室 我马上到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Keep Banner in the lab. I'm on my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.86,1:07:02.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把托尔也找去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Send Thor as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.50,1:07:07.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢合作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you for your cooperation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.28,1:07:17.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么 斯塔克先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you doing, Mr Stark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.80,1:07:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这话我还想问你呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kind of been wondering the same thing about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.32,1:07:22.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该去搜寻宇宙魔方的下落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're supposed to be locating the Tesseract.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.24,1:07:23.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在搜 搜索模型已锁定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are. The model's locked{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.88,1:07:25.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在扫描搜索信号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and we're sweeping for the signature now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.24,1:07:26.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一有结果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When we get a hit,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.32,1:07:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能把范围缩小至八百米内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we'll have the location within half a mile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.29,1:07:32.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后你就能拿回魔方 稍安毋躁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, then you get your Cube back. No muss, no fuss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.32,1:07:34.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二阶段是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is "Phase 2"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.52,1:07:39.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二阶段是神盾局将魔方用于制造武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Phase 2 is S.H.I.E.L.D. Uses the Cube to make weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.36,1:07:41.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我等不起计算机了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sorry, computer was moving a little slow for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.16,1:07:43.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗杰斯 我们搜集所有与魔方相关的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rogers, we gathered everything related to the Tesseract.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.88,1:07:45.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这并不意味着我们…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This does not mean that we're making...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.40,1:07:46.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打断一下 尼克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sorry, Nick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.48,1:07:48.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还想怎么编{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What were you lying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.20,1:07:50.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我错了 局长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was wrong, Director.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.52,1:07:51.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界还是那个老样子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The world hasn't changed a bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.64,1:07:52.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这事你知情吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you know about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.76,1:07:55.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不是离开这里 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You want to think about removing yourself from this environment, Doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.56,1:07:57.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在加尔各答（印度城市）时离这儿远着呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was in Calcutta. I was pretty well removed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.26,1:07:59.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛基想摆布你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Loki is manipulating you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.50,1:08:01.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就不是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you've been doing what, exactly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.14,1:08:02.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯来不是被我的秋波打动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You didn't come here because I bat my eyelashes at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.86,1:08:05.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 我也不会因为你突然觉得不安就走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, and I'm not leaving because suddenly you get a little twitchy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.42,1:08:06.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解释一下神盾局干嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd like to know why S.H.I.E.L.D.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.10,1:08:10.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要用宇宙魔方开发大规模杀伤性武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is using the Tesseract to build weapons of mass destruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.26,1:08:12.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.28,1:08:15.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关我什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.16,1:08:18.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去年 一个外星来客光临地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Last year, Earth had a visitor from another planet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.56,1:08:21.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两虎相争 结果踏平了一座小镇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who had a grudge match that levelled a small town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.72,1:08:23.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不仅得知了宇宙中其他生命的存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We learned that not only are we not alone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.96,1:08:27.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还发现我们的武力远远落后于他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but we are hopelessly, hilariously, outgunned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.22,1:08:30.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的人民只想与地球和平相处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My people want nothing but peace with your planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.50,1:08:32.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可你们不是唯一的外星生命吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But you're not the only people out there, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.50,1:08:34.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有别的生物对我们构成威胁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you're not the only threat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.50,1:08:37.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙到处是无可匹敌的强手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The world's filling up with people who can't be matched,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.18,1:08:39.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁都控制不了他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that can't be controlled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.46,1:08:40.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想像控制魔方那样控制他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like you controlled the Cube?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.66,1:08:41.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正因为你们用宇宙魔方制武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your work with the Tesseract{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.98,1:08:44.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才招来了洛基和他的同伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is what drew Loki to it, and his allies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.28,1:08:46.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这是给其他文明发出了信号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a signal to all the realms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.72,1:08:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宣告地球已准备好展开高级战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that the Earth is ready for a higher form of war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.40,1:08:50.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高级{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A higher form?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.56,1:08:51.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不是你逼的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You forced our hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.64,1:08:52.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们总得想个办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We had to come up with something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.72,1:08:53.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是想到了"核威慑"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A nuclear deterrent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.80,1:08:55.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这总能平息事态{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because that always calms everything right down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.24,1:08:58.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯塔克 别忘了你的发家史{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Remind me again how you made your fortune, Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.64,1:09:00.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是斯塔克还在造军火 肯定早就…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sure if he still made weapons, Stark would be neck-deep...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.04,1:09:02.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 干嘛 这怎么冲我来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold on. How is this now about me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.72,1:09:03.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么 你不总是焦点吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sorry, isn't everything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.92,1:09:05.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到人类这么野蛮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought humans were more evolved than this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.24,1:09:08.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂 人类跑去炸你家了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Excuse me, did we come to your planet and blow stuff up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.12,1:09:10.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你居然如此不信任你们的守护者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You treat your champions with such mistrust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.04,1:09:12.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们怎么这么幼稚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you boys really that naive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.56,1:09:14.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神盾局监视所有潜在威胁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}S.H.I.E.L.D. monitors potential threats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.48,1:09:15.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国队长也是威胁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Captain America's on threat watch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.84,1:09:16.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We all are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.92,1:09:18.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也上黑名单了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait, you're on that list?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.40,1:09:19.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟愤怒的蜜蜂（游戏名）谁更靠前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you above or below angry bees?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.20,1:09:22.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史塔克 你再犯贫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stark, so help me God, if you make one more wisecrack...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.36,1:09:23.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是口头威胁啊 我好怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Threat! Verbal threat. I feel threatened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.68,1:09:26.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 放尊重点 - 尊重什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Show some respect. - Respect what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.22,1:09:37.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,66B号运输机 请上报确认口令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Transport Six-Six-Bravo, please relay confirm codes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.14,1:09:39.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,系统里有你的资料 但没有航行记录{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've got you on the computer, but not on the day log.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.34,1:09:41.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请上报运输货物 完毕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is your haul? Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.46,1:09:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,武器弹药 完毕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Arms and ammunition. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.28,1:09:54.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你嘴上说要控制 却惟恐天下不乱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You speak of control, yet you court chaos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.52,1:09:56.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就这作风 不是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's his M.O., isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.28,1:09:57.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们算哪门子团队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, what are we, a team?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.60,1:10:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 把我们搞在一起只会引发混乱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, we're a chemical mixture that makes chaos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.56,1:10:02.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们…就是定时炸弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're a time bomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.26,1:10:05.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别起哄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You need to step away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.14,1:10:06.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干嘛不让他发发火 泄泄气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why shouldn't the guy let off a little steam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.02,1:10:09.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你明知故问 别捣乱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know damn well why. Back off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.18,1:10:11.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想看你有没有本事逼我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm starting to want you to make me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.42,1:10:14.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你厉害 穿着铁甲充大侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah. Big man in a suit of armour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.02,1:10:16.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脱下铁甲 你还剩什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take that off, what are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.24,1:10:19.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天才 大款 花心萝卜 慈善家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Genius, billionaire, playboy, philanthropist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.32,1:10:23.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认识很多平凡的人 却胜你十倍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know guys with none of that worth ten of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.48,1:10:24.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看你的资料了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've seen the footage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.56,1:10:26.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就只在乎你自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The only thing you really fight for is yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.12,1:10:29.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是那种会做出牺牲的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're not the guy to make the sacrifice play,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.08,1:10:32.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,匐在铁丝网上让战友爬过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to lay down on a wire and let the other guy crawl over you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.60,1:10:34.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我就剪断铁丝网{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think I would just cut the wire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.26,1:10:40.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总有鬼主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Always a way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.50,1:10:41.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也许不算是威胁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You may not be a threat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.82,1:10:43.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你也别再扮英雄了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but you better stop pretending to be a hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.78,1:10:46.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那样的英雄吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A hero? Like you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.26,1:10:48.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是个实验产物 罗杰斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're a laboratory experiment, Rogers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.34,1:10:51.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从一瓶血清里获得了特殊能力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything special about you came out of a bottle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.26,1:11:19.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿上铁甲 我们大战几个回合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Put on the suit. Let's go a few rounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.94,1:11:24.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们真小 小肚鸡肠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You people are so petty and tiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.38,1:11:25.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我们的团队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, this is a team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.46,1:11:26.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗曼诺夫探员 请你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Agent Romanoff, would you escort{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.78,1:11:27.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,护送班纳博士回他的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dr Banner back to his...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.98,1:11:29.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪儿 你把我房间租出去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where? You rented my room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.20,1:11:32.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个隔间只是…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The cell was just in case...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.72,1:11:34.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为万一你要杀我准备的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In case you needed to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.32,1:11:37.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可你杀不了 我试过 所以我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But you can't. I know, I tried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.20,1:11:41.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一度心灰意冷 觉得这种日子没有尽头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I got low. I didn't see an end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.12,1:11:46.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就想吞枪自杀 那个家伙却把子弹吐了出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, I put a bullet in my mouth, and the other guy spit it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.96,1:11:48.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只好活下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So I moved on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.24,1:11:50.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一心行医济世 本来好端端的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I focused on helping other people. I was good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.08,1:11:53.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却被你拉来跟这些怪胎为伍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Until you dragged me back into this freak show{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.32,1:11:54.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危及所有人的安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and put everyone here at risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.76,1:11:56.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是问我有什么绝招吗 罗曼诺夫探员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You want to know my secret, Agent Romanoff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.88,1:11:58.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是怎么保持冷静的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You want to know how I stay calm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.22,1:12:04.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,班纳博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dr Banner,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.06,1:12:06.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放下权杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}put down the sceptre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.46,1:12:12.77,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,(能量信号吻合度95%){\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.24,1:12:16.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.16,1:12:18.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉了 孩子们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sorry, kids,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.24,1:12:19.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没机会看我亮绝活儿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you don't get to see my party trick after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.04,1:12:20.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙魔方找到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You located the Tesseract?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.12,1:12:22.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能最快赶过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I could get there fastest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.20,1:12:24.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙魔方是阿斯加德的 人类消受不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Tesseract belongs on Asgard. No human is a match for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.36,1:12:25.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你不能自己去 - 有本事你就拦我啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You're not going alone. - You're gonna stop me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.26,1:12:27.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿上铁甲 看谁厉害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Put on the suit, let's find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.34,1:12:28.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打老年人我毫无压力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not afraid to hit an old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.70,1:12:29.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去穿铁甲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Put on the suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.14,1:12:32.09,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,(能量信号吻合度99%){\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.09,1:12:32.40,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,(能量信号吻合度100%){\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.42,1:12:33.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.26,1:12:51.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖 去穿铁甲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Put on the suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.34,1:12:52.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.22,1:12:56.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全体人员就位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All hands to stations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.86,1:13:02.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 希尔 - 航母外部爆炸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hill! - External detonation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.70,1:13:03.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三号引擎停机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Number three engine is down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.02,1:13:04.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们受袭了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We've been hit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.10,1:13:06.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 能修好吗 - 3号引擎失火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Can they get it running? - Fire in engine three!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.24,1:13:08.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Talk to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.32,1:13:09.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,涡轮机看来没大碍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Turbine looks mostly intact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.00,1:13:11.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但飞行状态下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but it's impossible to get out there to make repairs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.92,1:13:13.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无法进入故障区维修{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}while we're in the air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.40,1:13:15.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再停一个引擎我们就飞不起来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If we lose one more engine we won't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.96,1:13:17.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得找人出去修引擎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Somebody's got to get outside and patch that engine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.00,1:13:19.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 斯塔克 听到没 - 这就去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Stark, you copy that? - I'm on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.76,1:13:22.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科尔森 启动关押区防御性封锁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Coulson, initiate defensive lockdown in the detention section,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.04,1:13:23.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后去军械库{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then get to the armoury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.12,1:13:25.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗曼诺夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Romanoff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.68,1:13:30.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.56,1:13:33.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're okay, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.24,1:13:48.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别让引擎启动 - 遵命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Keep that engine down! - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.52,1:13:50.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去关押层 等摄像头关闭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Detention, wait for cameras to go dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.57,1:13:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 收到 - 跟紧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Got it. - Stay close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.68,1:13:55.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走 去4层{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's go, Level 4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.04,1:13:58.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三号引擎 去那儿见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Engine three. I'll meet you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.26,1:14:08.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.66,1:14:11.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bruce?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.90,1:14:15.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撑住啊 洛基就等着你失控呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You got to fight it. This is just what Loki wants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.74,1:14:17.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会有事的 听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're going to be okay. Listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.86,1:14:18.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你受伤了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you hurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.98,1:14:24.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会有事 听到了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're going to be okay. All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.22,1:14:26.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以生命起誓 会带你出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I swear on my life I will get you out of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.98,1:14:28.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用蹚这浑水 再也不…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will walk away and never ever...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.20,1:14:31.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.24,1:14:49.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bruce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.28,1:15:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,调转航母 航向180 向南行进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bring the carrier about to a 1-8-0, heading south!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.52,1:15:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 开上海域 - 我们在仪表飞行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Take us to the water! - We're flying blind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.24,1:15:33.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎故障后 导航系统重置了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Navigation's recalibrating after the engine failure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.28,1:15:34.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天上有太阳没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is the sun coming up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.68,1:15:37.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是的 长官 - 保持太阳在航母左侧行进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yes, sir. - Then put it on the left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.92,1:15:39.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上海域{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get us over water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.64,1:15:41.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再有涡轮熄火就要坠毁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One more turbine goes down, and we drop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.80,1:15:45.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.24,1:15:49.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯塔克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stark!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.96,1:15:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯塔克 我来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stark, I'm here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.68,1:15:55.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.28,1:15:58.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看是什么情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's see what we've got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.32,1:16:00.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得先把超导冷却系统接好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I got to get this superconducting coolant system back online{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.12,1:16:02.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才能进入转子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before I can access the rotors,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.64,1:16:04.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,清理残骸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}work on dislodging the debris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.24,1:16:09.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去引擎控制面板那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need you to get to that engine control panel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.84,1:16:13.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我哪些继电器过载了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and tell me which relays are in overload position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.16,1:16:26.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快说你看到了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What does it look like in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.22,1:16:30.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是某种电器设备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems to run on some form of electricity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.78,1:16:32.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球人都知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, you're not wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.26,1:17:38.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,班纳 我们是友不是敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are not your enemies, Banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.10,1:17:40.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,清醒过来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Try to think!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.78,1:17:51.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继电器没问题了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, the relays are intact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.70,1:17:53.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后干嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's our next move?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.22,1:17:54.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算我把残骸都清走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even if I clear the rotors,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.30,1:17:56.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有助力转子也无法启动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}this thing won't re-engage without a jump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.24,1:17:58.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得进去推着它转{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm going to have to get in there and push.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.68,1:18:00.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转速一起来 就会把你绞成肉泥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If that thing gets up to speed, you'll get shredded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.78,1:18:01.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就扳动控制器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That stator control unit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.99,1:18:03.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样磁极就会反转{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}can reverse the polarity long enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.33,1:18:04.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直至磁悬浮解除…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to disengage maglev and that could...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.55,1:18:05.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说人话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Speak English!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.56,1:18:07.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到红色的控制杆了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You see that red lever?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.88,1:18:10.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让转子减速 给我飞出来的时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will slow the rotors down long enough for me to get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.04,1:18:12.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待在那儿等我指令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stand by it. Wait for my word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.20,1:19:07.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撤离下层飞机库甲板上的全部人员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We need full evac on the lower hangar bay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.00,1:19:11.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心手雷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Grenade!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.22,1:19:28.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人入侵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We've got a perimeter breach!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.62,1:19:30.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神盾设施内有敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hostiles are in S.H.I.E.L.D. Gear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.70,1:19:32.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全体人员注意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Call-outs at every junction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.20,1:19:42.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绿巨人和托尔在4层研发层{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have the Hulk and Thor on Research Level 4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.44,1:19:43.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,2和3层摄像头损坏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Levels 2 and 3 are dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.04,1:19:46.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官 绿巨人会把这里彻底毁掉的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir, the Hulk will tear this place apart!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.24,1:19:48.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就调虎离山{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get his attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.32,1:19:52.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,60护航机前往Y型区 火力牵制敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Escort 6-0, proceed to Wishbone and engage hostile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.44,1:19:53.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保持距离{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't get too close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.80,1:19:55.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Copy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.26,1:20:08.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到目标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Target acquired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.70,1:20:13.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Target engaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.82,1:20:26.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标火了 他发火了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Target angry, target angry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.20,1:21:38.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们又没来过这儿 怎么这么轻车熟路的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're not getting through here, so what the hell...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.06,1:21:53.75,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,(一号引擎出现故障){\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.96,1:21:58.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一号引擎停机了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Engine one is now in shut-down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.20,1:22:08.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在失控下降{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are in an uncontrolled descent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.20,1:22:10.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官 一号引擎彻底停转{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir, we've lost all power in engine one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.52,1:22:13.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是巴顿 他毁了我们的系统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's Barton. He took out our systems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.40,1:22:15.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他去关押层了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's headed for the detention level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.92,1:22:17.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人听到吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does anybody copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.92,1:22:20.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是罗曼诺夫探员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is Agent Romanoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.08,1:22:22.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I copy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.22,1:22:29.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯塔克 航母在下降{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stark, we're losing altitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.30,1:22:30.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, I noticed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.54,1:22:59.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.22,1:23:10.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可真是记吃不记打{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you ever not going to fall for that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.26,1:23:56.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类认为我们有不死之身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The humans think us immortal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.46,1:23:58.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,检验一下吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Should we test that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.62,1:24:02.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到那边去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move away, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.06,1:24:08.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帅不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You like this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.42,1:24:12.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你的毁灭者 我们研发了这个的原型机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We started working on the prototype after you sent the Destroyer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.70,1:24:15.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都不清楚它的威力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even I don't know what it does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.62,1:24:17.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想试试吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you want to find out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.20,1:24:21.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.28,1:25:32.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娜塔莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Natasha?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.22,1:26:06.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必输无疑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're going to lose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.86,1:26:10.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.26,1:26:13.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你本性使然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's in your nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.74,1:26:17.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们那些英雄被杀得七零八落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your heroes are scattered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.10,1:26:21.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的飞堡行将陨落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your floating fortress falls from the sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.78,1:26:23.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么看出败局的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is my disadvantage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.98,1:26:25.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没有信念{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You lack conviction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.78,1:26:27.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't think I'm...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.30,1:26:35.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么威武啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, that's what it does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.24,1:26:41.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高度\N所有人员立即前往紧急中心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All hands to crash stations immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.22,1:27:10.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长 扳控制杆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cap, hit the lever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.54,1:27:13.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暂时不太方便{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need a minute here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.14,1:27:14.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扳控制杆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lever{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.30,1:27:15.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.26,1:27:29.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.20,1:28:05.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 头儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sorry, boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.64,1:28:07.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斑比逃了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The god rabbited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.40,1:28:08.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保持清醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just stay awake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.92,1:28:10.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eyes on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.60,1:28:12.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了 我得离岗了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, I'm clocking out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.20,1:28:13.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不批准{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not an option.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.60,1:28:16.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事 头儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's okay, boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.22,1:28:21.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要他们成为真正的团队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This was never gonna work{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.30,1:28:22.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就得给他们点…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if they didn't have something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.82,1:28:25.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.22,1:28:56.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科尔森探员殉职了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Agent Coulson is down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.30,1:28:59.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医疗队正在赶去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A medical team is on its way to your location.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.06,1:29:01.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.54,1:29:06.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们宣布死亡了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They called it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.90,1:29:24.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些卡片揣在菲尔·科尔森的外衣口袋里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These were in Phil Coulson's jacket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.66,1:29:28.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来他没要到你的签名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I guess he never did get you to sign them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.26,1:29:34.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在耳聋眼瞎 一筹莫展{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're dead in the air up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.98,1:29:37.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通讯中断 魔方下落不明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our communications, the location of the Cube,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.06,1:29:40.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还弄丢了班纳和托尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Banner, Thor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.62,1:29:43.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没辙了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I got nothing for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.58,1:29:46.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最得力手下也牺牲了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I lost my one good eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.30,1:29:52.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许是我自找的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe I had that coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.22,1:29:57.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.28,1:30:02.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是想将宇宙魔方用于制武{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we were going to build an arsenal with the Tesseract.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.88,1:30:05.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我就没把宝都压在这事上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never put all my chips on that number, though,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.84,1:30:08.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我还有个更大胆的计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}because I was playing something even riskier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.56,1:30:16.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有个设想 这事斯塔克知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There was an idea, Stark knows this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.22,1:30:22.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫做"复仇者计划"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}called the Avengers Initiative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.58,1:30:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是将一些能力超群的人召集起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The idea was to bring together a group of remarkable people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.94,1:30:31.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看他们所组成的团队能否更加强大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to see if they could become something more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.98,1:30:36.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看他们能否在危急时刻并肩战斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To see if they could work together when we needed them to,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.10,1:30:40.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赢得那些我们赢不了的战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to fight the battles that we never could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.24,1:30:48.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲尔·科尔森到死都相信这个设想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Phil Coulson died still believing in that idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.12,1:30:52.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In heroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.48,1:31:01.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.80,1:31:05.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这观念的确过时了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's an old-fashioned notion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.24,1:31:28.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你从天而降{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You fell out of the sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.08,1:31:43.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我伤着谁了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did I hurt anybody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.64,1:31:46.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这附近就没人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's nobody around here to get hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.68,1:31:49.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过你把鸽子都吓坏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You did scare the hell out of some pigeons, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.24,1:31:53.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那真走运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.36,1:31:54.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者是你瞄得准{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or just good aim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.04,1:31:56.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,落下来时你还醒着呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were awake when you fell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.56,1:32:00.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你都看见了 - 都看到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You saw? - The whole thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.64,1:32:02.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你穿透屋顶摔下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right through the ceiling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.32,1:32:06.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大大的 绿绿的 还光着屁股{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Big and green and buck-ass nude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.24,1:32:07.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.64,1:32:10.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我估计得等你缩到常人的身材{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Didn't think those would fit you until you shrunk down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.84,1:32:13.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才能穿上这衣服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to a regular-size feller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.40,1:32:16.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.20,1:32:19.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是外星人吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you an alien?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.96,1:32:21.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.40,1:32:22.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是外太空来的人吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From outer space, an alien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.28,1:32:24.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.60,1:32:27.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你这娃可有病啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, then, son, you've got a condition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.20,1:32:41.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克林特 你会没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Clint. You're going to be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.64,1:32:46.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.44,1:32:49.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that what you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.83,1:32:54.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能放松{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've got no window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.12,1:32:56.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得把他赶出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have to flush him out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.22,1:32:59.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可不容易 得慢慢来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You got to level out. It's going to take time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.10,1:33:01.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不懂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.46,1:33:06.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道被人夺去意志 肆意摆布的滋味吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you ever had someone take your brain and play?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.34,1:33:11.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你拽出来 把别人放进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pull you out and stuff something else in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.38,1:33:16.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道被瓦解的感觉吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you know what it's like to be unmade?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.14,1:33:20.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你明知我了解那种感受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know that I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.20,1:33:29.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么恢复的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why am I back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.28,1:33:31.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么把他弄出去的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How did you get him out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.72,1:33:34.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认知重校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cognitive recalibration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.56,1:33:37.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,俗称敲脑瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hit you really hard on the head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.28,1:33:38.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.44,1:33:44.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娜塔莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Natasha...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.26,1:33:47.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我杀了多少探…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How many agents did I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.42,1:33:48.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.94,1:33:51.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别去折磨自己 克林特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't do that to yourself, Clint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.62,1:33:53.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作恶的是洛基{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is Loki.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.38,1:33:55.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是怪物 是魔法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is monsters and magic,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.02,1:33:57.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我们闻所未闻的敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and nothing we were ever trained for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.70,1:33:59.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛基 他跑了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Loki, did he get away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.30,1:34:00.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.58,1:34:02.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道他去哪了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't suppose you know where.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.86,1:34:04.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轮不到我多管{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I didn't need to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.70,1:34:06.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就没问{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I didn't ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.20,1:34:12.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过他很快就会行动了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's going to make his play soon, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.92,1:34:13.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在今天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.00,1:34:15.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得阻止他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We got to stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.92,1:34:17.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 谁是我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah? Who's "we"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.24,1:34:19.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道 活下来的人吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know. Whoever's left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.28,1:34:21.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.20,1:34:25.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我能一箭射穿洛基的眼窝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if I put an arrow through Loki's eye socket,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.40,1:34:27.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也能睡好觉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would sleep better, I suppose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.72,1:34:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这话才像你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now you sound like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.92,1:34:34.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可你不像你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But you don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.26,1:34:39.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是间谍 不是士兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're a spy, not a soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.10,1:34:44.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会想去冲锋陷阵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now you want to wade into a war. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.34,1:34:48.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛基把你怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What did Loki do to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.94,1:34:51.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没怎么 我只是…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He didn't. I just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.86,1:34:56.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娜塔莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Natasha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.24,1:35:01.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我被他说动了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've been compromised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.12,1:35:06.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我欠了血债{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I got red in my ledger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.20,1:35:10.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要还掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would like to wipe it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.26,1:35:27.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他成家了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was he married?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.82,1:35:29.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.30,1:35:33.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个女友 好像是大提琴手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There was a cellist, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.86,1:35:36.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可惜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.90,1:35:38.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他看着人不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He seemed like a good man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.24,1:35:41.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是个傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was an idiot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.40,1:35:43.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么 就因为他有信仰吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why? For believing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.68,1:35:45.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他独自去跟洛基叫板{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For taking on Loki alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.16,1:35:46.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那叫尽职尽责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was doing his job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.92,1:35:49.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那叫自不量力 他该等支援{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was out of his league. He should have waited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.20,1:35:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他该…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He should have...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.32,1:35:52.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候就是没别的办法 托尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sometimes there isn't a way out, Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.96,1:35:54.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 这话挺耳熟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right, I've heard that before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.12,1:35:56.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你第一次失去战友吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is this the first time you lost a soldier?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.68,1:35:58.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是战士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are not soldiers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.68,1:36:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会听令于弗瑞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not marching to Fury's fife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.48,1:36:05.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Neither am I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.72,1:36:07.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也该为洛基犯下的罪行负责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's got the same blood on his hands that Loki does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.96,1:36:09.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那些我们得先放放{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But right now, we got to put that behind us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.40,1:36:11.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对付外敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and get this done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.24,1:36:13.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛基需要一个能量源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Loki needs a power source.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.32,1:36:14.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我们能列出…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If we can put together a list...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.40,1:36:15.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把大战弄成了私仇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He made it personal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.52,1:36:16.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是重点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's not the point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.64,1:36:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是重点 这就是洛基的目的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is the point. That's Loki's point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.04,1:36:20.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他干嘛直捣我们的老巢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He hit us all right where we live. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.00,1:36:21.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好击溃我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To tear us apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.20,1:36:23.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 分散击破的确是妙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, divide and conquer is great{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.20,1:36:26.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他知道我们是他大业的绊脚石 对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but he knows he has to take us out to win, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.68,1:36:28.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这才是他的心结{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's what he wants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.28,1:36:30.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想打败我们 还要别人看着他赢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He wants to beat us, he wants to be seen doing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.20,1:36:33.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想要观众{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He wants an audience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.96,1:36:36.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我在斯图加特就正碰上他的表演{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right. I caught his act in Stuttgart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.05,1:36:37.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 那只是试映 这是…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, that was just previews.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.60,1:36:39.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是首演之夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is opening night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.13,1:36:41.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛基就是这场戏的主角{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Loki, he's a full-tilt diva, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.16,1:36:42.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要人给他献花 还要四处招摇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He wants flowers, he wants parades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.80,1:36:46.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要一座高耸入云的纪念碑 上面刻着他的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He wants a monument built to the skies with his name plastered...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.12,1:36:49.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗娘养的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.25,1:36:58.01,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,(斯塔克){\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.14,1:37:02.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Time to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.26,1:37:03.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 去哪 - 路上说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Go where? - I'll tell you on the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.86,1:37:04.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会开飞机吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can you fly one of those jets?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.34,1:37:07.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.26,1:37:12.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有战衣吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You got a suit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.38,1:37:13.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.46,1:37:14.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就去穿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then suit up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.28,1:37:44.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未经允许你们不得登机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, you guys aren't authorised to be in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.64,1:37:46.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子 省省吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Son, just don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.84,1:37:49.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.92,1:37:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希尔探员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Agent Hill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.60,1:37:53.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些卡片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Those cards,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.12,1:37:59.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是放在科尔森的衣柜里 而不是外衣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they were in Coulson's locker, not in his jacket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.24,1:38:05.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们需要点动力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They needed the push.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.72,1:38:10.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,6号停机坪有人私自起飞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have an unauthorised departure from Bay 6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.26,1:38:13.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们找到洛基了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They found him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.34,1:38:17.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想尽一切办法恢复通讯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get our communications back up, whatever you have to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.02,1:38:20.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我要监控全局 - 遵命 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I want eyes on everything. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.28,1:38:35.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生 我已关闭方舟反应堆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir, I've turned off the arc reactor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.08,1:38:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那个装置已能自续供能了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but the device is already self-sustaining.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.88,1:38:41.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关掉它 塞尔维格博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shut it down, Dr Selvig.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.60,1:38:43.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太迟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's too late!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.80,1:38:47.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在没法停了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She can't stop now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.20,1:38:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她有东西要给我们看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She wants to show us something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.68,1:38:52.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个新宇宙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A new universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.76,1:38:54.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.20,1:39:03.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那层屏障是纯能量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The barrier is pure energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.12,1:39:05.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无法打破{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's unbreachable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.04,1:39:07.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看出来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, I got that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.92,1:39:09.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,换招{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Plan B.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.00,1:39:12.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生 马克7型尚不能调用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir, the Mark 7 is not ready for deployment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.12,1:39:15.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就不要轮子了 我们没时间了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then skip the spinning rims. We're on the clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.20,1:39:38.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是来求我发慈悲的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please tell me you're going to appeal to my humanity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.20,1:39:41.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我是来吓唬你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Actually, I'm planning to threaten you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.60,1:39:42.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你可不该把铁甲脱了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You should have left your armour on for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.12,1:39:44.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.60,1:39:45.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过感觉穿上也没用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's seen a bit of mileage,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.76,1:39:48.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟你拿着终结者型蓝杖呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you've got the glow stick of destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.04,1:39:51.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来一杯吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would you like a drink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.56,1:39:52.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拖时间是没用的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stalling me won't change anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.99,1:39:54.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不 是吓唬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no. Threatening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.22,1:39:56.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不喝吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No drink? Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.66,1:39:58.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可要来一杯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm having one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.14,1:40:02.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,齐塔瑞大军要来了 谁都休想阻止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Chitauri are coming. Nothing will change that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.24,1:40:05.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还怕什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What have I to fear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.72,1:40:07.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,复仇者联盟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Avengers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.36,1:40:11.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们给自己起的名字 就是个团队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's what we call ourselves. We're sort of like a team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.72,1:40:13.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全球最猛的英雄什么的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Earth's mightiest heroes" type thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.20,1:40:15.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见过了 不过如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, I've met them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.12,1:40:17.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.24,1:40:19.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我承认磨合是花了些时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It takes us a while to get any traction, I'll give you that one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.56,1:40:21.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我们来数数吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But let's do a head count, here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.80,1:40:24.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有你的半神老哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your brother, the demigod,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.84,1:40:27.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一名超级大兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a super soldier,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.46,1:40:29.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不负盛名的活传奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a living legend who kind of lives up to the legend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.40,1:40:32.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个发起脾气能吓死人的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man with breathtaking anger-management issues,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.26,1:40:36.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个顶级刺客 而你小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a couple of master assassins, and you, big fella,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.82,1:40:39.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他们都惹恼了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you've managed to piss off every single one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.78,1:40:40.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是这么打算的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That was the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.86,1:40:42.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看你是没想清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not a great plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.90,1:40:44.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等他们来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When they come,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.98,1:40:46.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心 他们会来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and they will,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.50,1:40:47.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是冤有头债有主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they'll come for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.82,1:40:48.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有一支大军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have an army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.90,1:40:50.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有绿巨人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have a Hulk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.50,1:40:51.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那野兽不是跑丢了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought the beast had wandered off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.24,1:40:54.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重点不在那儿 你别做皇帝梦了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're missing the point. There is no throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.20,1:40:58.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是绝不可能称王称霸的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no version of this where you come out on top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.16,1:41:00.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许你大军降至 或许我们抵挡不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe your army comes and maybe it's too much for us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.52,1:41:02.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但帐都会记到你头上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but it's all on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.20,1:41:05.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要是保护不了地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because if we can't protect the Earth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.40,1:41:08.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对会为之复仇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you can be damn well sure we'll avenge it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.36,1:41:13.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是他们忙着打你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How will your friends have time for me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.40,1:41:15.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有时间陪我玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when they are so busy fighting you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.24,1:41:24.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前没出过问题啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This usually works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.36,1:41:27.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,性能失常神马的 也不算罕见啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, performance issues, it's not uncommon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.20,1:41:29.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五个男人就有一个…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One out of five...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.44,1:41:33.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贾维斯 随时可以了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jarvis, anytime now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.92,1:41:37.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都会败在我脚下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will all fall before me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.68,1:41:38.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,调用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Deploy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.12,1:41:40.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Deploy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.26,1:42:11.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还惹恼了一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And there's one other person you pissed off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.18,1:42:13.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫菲尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His name was Phil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.18,1:42:37.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.24,1:42:40.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大军来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.24,1:43:53.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛基{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Loki!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.60,1:43:55.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关掉宇宙魔方 不然我毁了它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Turn off the Tesseract, or I'll destroy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.68,1:43:56.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你毁不掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.80,1:43:58.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停不下来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no stopping it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.72,1:44:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在只能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is only{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.56,1:44:01.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.76,1:44:02.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So be it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.24,1:44:27.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯塔克 我们在三点钟方向 航向东北{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stark, we're on your three, headed northeast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.04,1:44:30.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说你们还去买外卖了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What? Did you stop for drive-through?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.20,1:44:31.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帕克大街 我引他们过去给你们当靶子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Swing up Park. I'm going to lay them out for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.16,1:44:50.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生 又来人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir, we have more incoming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.26,1:44:52.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 去招呼招呼他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fine. Let's keep them occupied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.54,1:45:01.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 小娜 - 我看见他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Nat? - I see him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.26,1:45:48.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得回上面去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We got to get back up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.22,1:46:40.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯塔克 看见这怪物了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stark, are you seeing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.54,1:46:43.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看见了 还不敢相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seeing. Still working on believing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.02,1:46:45.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,班纳来了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where's Banner? Has he shown up yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.46,1:46:46.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,班纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Banner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.58,1:46:47.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他到了就告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just keep me posted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.26,1:46:50.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贾维斯 找到这东西的软肋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jarvis, find me a soft spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.50,1:46:54.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你瞧啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look at this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.22,1:46:56.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look around you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.14,1:47:00.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为你称了王 杀戮就会结束吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You think this madness will end with your rule?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.98,1:47:02.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太迟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.86,1:47:05.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想阻止也来不及了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's too late to stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.18,1:47:08.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来得及 兄弟齐心 其利断金{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. We can, together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.22,1:47:17.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妇人之仁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sentiment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.20,1:47:48.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有平民被困在…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We've got civilians still trapped up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.76,1:47:50.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛基{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Loki.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.88,1:48:03.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在下面只有挨打的份儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're fish in a barrel down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.84,1:48:10.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边有我们 没问题的 你走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We got this. It's good. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.84,1:48:12.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你挡得住他们吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you think you can hold them off?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.28,1:48:13.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Captain,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.16,1:48:17.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我乐意之至{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it would be my genuine pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.24,1:48:47.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟布达佩斯那次一模一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just like Budapest all over again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.48,1:48:50.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们想的一定不是一个布达佩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You and I remember Budapest very differently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.26,1:49:08.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国民警卫队集结{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's going to be an hour{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.34,1:49:09.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要一小时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before they can scramble the National Guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.70,1:49:11.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国民警卫队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}National Guard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.34,1:49:13.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,军队知道这边发生了什么吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does the army know what's happening here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.02,1:49:14.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们知道吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.14,1:49:17.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派人进这几栋楼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You need men in these buildings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.42,1:49:18.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,楼里的人可能会慌不择路地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are people inside and they're going to be running{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.98,1:49:20.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撞到枪口上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}right into the line of fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.26,1:49:22.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你带他们走地下室或者地铁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You take them to the basements or through the subway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.22,1:49:23.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让他们到街上来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You keep them off the streets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.86,1:49:26.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直到39大街全部封锁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need a perimeter as far back as 39th.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.50,1:49:28.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我凭什么听你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why the hell should I take orders from you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.24,1:49:43.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派人进这几栋楼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need men in those buildings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.52,1:49:45.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把人往地下带 别到街上来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lead the people down and away from the streets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.64,1:49:46.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直到39大街{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're going to set up a{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.51,1:49:48.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要全部封锁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}perimeter all the way down to 39th Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.28,1:49:59.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 这下它盯上我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, we got its attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.92,1:50:01.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What the hell was step two?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.24,1:50:33.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面怎么样了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's the story upstairs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.32,1:50:35.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包围魔方的能量无法穿透{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The power surrounding the Cube is impenetrable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.28,1:50:37.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尔说得对 我们得先对付这些怪物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thor's right. We got to deal with these guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.92,1:50:39.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么对付 - 齐心协力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- How do we do this? - As a team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.60,1:50:40.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟洛基还有帐要算{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have unfinished business with Loki.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.36,1:50:42.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 排个号吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah? Well, get in line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.48,1:50:43.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别闹了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Save it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.56,1:50:44.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛基会把战斗集中在我们身上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Loki's going to keep this fight focused on us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.96,1:50:45.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样正好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and that's what we need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.08,1:50:47.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有他控制着 场面会更乱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Without him, these things could run wild.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.80,1:50:50.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯塔克在上面 他会需要我们…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We got Stark up top. He's going to need us to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.28,1:51:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来挺吓人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, this all seems horrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.36,1:51:03.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我见过更吓人的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've seen worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.96,1:51:04.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.04,1:51:07.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事 我们正需要能吓住人的队友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, we could use a little worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.22,1:51:10.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 斯塔克 他来了 - 班纳吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Stark, we got him. - Banner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.66,1:51:11.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被你说中了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just like you said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.98,1:51:14.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他"变装" 我这就把好戏拉过去演{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then tell him to suit up. I'm bringing the party to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.28,1:51:23.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这有什么"好"的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't see how that's a party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.20,1:51:32.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,班纳博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dr Banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.84,1:51:35.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在可以发火了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now might be a really good time for you to get angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.56,1:51:38.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我的绝招 队长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's my secret, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.56,1:51:41.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直窝着火呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm always angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.26,1:51:55.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撑住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.20,1:52:26.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派出余部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Send the rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.16,1:52:34.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.48,1:52:35.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下命令吧 队长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Call it, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.76,1:52:36.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 都注意了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, listen up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.00,1:52:39.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不能关掉传送门 就得控制住局面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Until we can close that portal, our priority is containment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.20,1:52:41.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴顿 上那个屋顶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Barton, I want you on that roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.60,1:52:43.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼观八方 把大部和散兵的行踪都报出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eyes on everything. Call out patterns and strays.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.52,1:52:44.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯塔克 你守着封锁线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stark, you got the perimeter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.30,1:52:46.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凡是跑出三个街区的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anything gets more than three blocks out,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.54,1:52:48.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要么给赶回来 要么给灭了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you turn it back or you turn it to ash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.14,1:52:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 送我一程好吗 - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Can you give me a lift? - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.42,1:52:50.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓紧了 精灵小王子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Better clench up, Legolas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.20,1:52:56.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尔 你得去想办法堵上传送门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thor, you got to try and bottleneck that portal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.20,1:52:58.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,减缓他们进军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Slow them down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.44,1:53:00.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是能打闪吗 打着这帮混球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You got the lightning. Light the bastards up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.72,1:53:04.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和我 我们留在地面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You and me, we stay here on the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.40,1:53:05.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牵制兵力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We keep the fighting here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.52,1:53:06.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绿巨人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Hulk...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.08,1:53:10.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使劲砸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Smash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.22,1:54:05.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.30,1:54:07.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理事会来电{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Council is on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.94,1:54:15.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯塔克 你后面可跟了不少敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stark, you got a lot of strays sniffing your tail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.82,1:54:19.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是不想让他们到街上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm just trying to keep them off the streets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.18,1:54:21.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不会拐弯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, they can't bank worth a damn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.18,1:54:22.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找个死角{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So find a tight corner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.42,1:54:23.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 收到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will roger that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.24,1:54:49.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真烦人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.08,1:54:57.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,指挥得好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nice call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.76,1:54:58.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What else you got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:59.04,1:55:01.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尔在6大街跟一支飞行队干起来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thor is taking on a squadron down on Sixth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.84,1:55:03.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然不带我玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And he didn't invite me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.24,1:55:44.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长 如果不关上传送门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Captain, none of this is going to mean a damn thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.92,1:55:46.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们这么打也没用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if we don't close that portal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.24,1:55:47.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么武器都伤不了它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our biggest guns couldn't touch it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.96,1:55:50.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许得想别的办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, maybe it's not about guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.96,1:55:53.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想上去得找人捎你一道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you want to get up there, you're going to need a ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.28,1:55:56.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道找谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I got a ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.40,1:55:58.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过你得推我一把{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I could use a boost, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.88,1:56:01.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真要这么干吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you sure about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.28,1:56:04.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 肯定特带劲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah. It's gonna be fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.24,1:56:35.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转弯 转弯 快转啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, turn, turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.77,1:57:52.23,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.26,1:58:02.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长 42大街上过了麦迪逊大街的银行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Captain, the bank on 42nd past Madison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.22,1:58:03.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多平民被敌人困在那里面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They've cornered a lot of civilians in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.02,1:58:05.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这就去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:25.14,1:58:26.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家让开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everyone! Clear out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.24,1:58:59.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗瑞局长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Director Fury,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.96,1:59:01.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理事会已做出决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Council has made a decision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.80,1:59:04.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这我知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I recognise the Council has made a decision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:04.56,1:59:06.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但鉴于这决定蠢到家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But given that it's a stupid-ass decision,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.20,1:59:07.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我打算不予理睬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have elected to ignore it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.68,1:59:10.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,局长 你的航母离那里最近{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Director, you're closer than any of our subs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.00,1:59:11.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻派出战机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You scramble that jet...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.08,1:59:14.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,议员 那可是曼哈顿岛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is the island of Manhattan, Councilman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.80,1:59:16.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非我的小分队确实撑不住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Until I'm certain my team can't hold it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.92,1:59:18.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会下令对平民百姓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will not order a nuclear strike{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.96,1:59:20.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实施核打击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}against a civilian population.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.44,1:59:22.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不在那儿消灭他们 世界都要遭殃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If we don't hold them here, we lose everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.88,1:59:25.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派出核战机才真的无法挽回{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I send that bird out, we already have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:30.22,1:59:31.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.02,1:59:35.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鹰眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hawkeye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.54,1:59:37.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小娜 你干什么呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nat, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.38,1:59:39.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮帮我啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A little help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.42,1:59:45.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:12.20,2:00:13.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.48,2:00:15.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都算什么东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are, all of you, beneath me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.96,2:00:18.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是神 你这蠢货{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am a god, you dull creature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:18.72,2:00:20.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这蚂蚁休想欺辱我…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I will not be bullied by...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:29.60,2:00:31.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弱爆了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Puny god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.20,2:00:41.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,权杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The sceptre...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.72,2:00:43.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.68,2:00:48.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛基的权杖 它的能量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Loki's sceptre. The energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.52,2:00:50.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙魔方无力抵抗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Tesseract can't fight,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.24,2:00:52.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它不能抵挡它自身的攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but you can't protect against yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.32,2:00:53.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别自责了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not your fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:53.40,2:00:54.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不知道自己在做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You didn't know what you were doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.22,2:01:00.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实 我好像知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Actually, I think I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.42,2:01:03.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我安了个可以切断能量源的保险装置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I built in a safety to cut their power source.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.42,2:01:05.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛基的权杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Loki's sceptre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.90,2:01:08.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许能关闭传送门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It may be able to close the portal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:10.38,2:01:12.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它就在那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I'm looking right at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.24,2:01:28.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生 我们所剩能量不够穿透它的外壳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir, we will lose power before we penetrate that shell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.32,2:01:38.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贾维斯 你听过约拿的故事吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jarvis, you ever hear the tale of Jonah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.60,2:01:40.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得他可不是好榜样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wouldn't consider him a role model.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.20,2:02:52.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗瑞局长已被解除指挥权{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Director Fury is no longer in command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.04,2:02:54.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,代行命令 7A11{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Override order 7-Alpha-1-1.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:55.12,2:02:57.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,7A11命令确认 我们可以起飞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}7-Alpha-1-1, confirmed. We're go for takeoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.44,2:03:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官 有架战机起动了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir, we have a bird in motion!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.92,2:03:02.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甲板上的人员请注意抗命战机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anyone on the deck, we have a rogue bird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.96,2:03:04.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得阻止它起飞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We need to shut it down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.32,2:03:06.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重复 起飞未经许可{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Repeat, takeoff is not authorised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.20,2:03:39.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯塔克 听见了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stark, do you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:39.40,2:03:41.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有枚导弹直奔你那儿去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have a missile headed straight for the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:41.96,2:03:43.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多久到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.40,2:03:45.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最多三分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Three minutes, max.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.52,2:03:47.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,载着核弹 能将市中心夷为平地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The payload will wipe out Midtown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:47.20,2:03:49.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贾维斯 将所剩动力全部输至推进器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jarvis, put everything we got into the thrusters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.28,2:03:50.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,输好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I just did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:05.24,2:04:06.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,核弹已投{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Package is sent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:06.64,2:04:09.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从现在起两分三十秒后爆炸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Detonation in 2 minutes, 30 seconds, mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.20,2:04:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好继续迎战了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you ready for another bout?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:35.12,2:04:36.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么 你要睡着了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What, are you getting sleepy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:41.48,2:04:43.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对准顶部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right at the crown!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:48.92,2:04:50.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能关掉它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can close it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:50.76,2:04:52.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们听见了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can anybody copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.24,2:04:54.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能关掉传送门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can shut the portal down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:54.44,2:04:56.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那就关啊 - 别 等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Do it! - No, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:56.52,2:04:57.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯塔克 敌人还在不断涌入{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stark, these things are still coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:57.84,2:04:58.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有枚核弹正往这儿飞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I got a nuke coming in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:58.92,2:05:00.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会在一分钟内爆炸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's gonna blow in less than a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:11.20,2:05:12.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经想好该把它送哪去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I know just where to put it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.84,2:05:22.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯塔克 你的能量不够往回走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stark, you know that's a one-way trip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:22.24,2:05:23.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留着能量拐弯吧 小贾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Save the rest for the turn, J.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.68,2:05:27.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生 要我给波茨小姐打电话吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir, shall I try Miss Potts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.72,2:05:29.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Might as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.22,2:05:34.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纽约街道成了战场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The streets of New York City have become a battleground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.40,2:05:37.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重大新闻 曼哈顿市中心遭袭\N军队已赶到 并努力压制敌军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Army is here trying to contain the violence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.34,2:05:38.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但显然力不从心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but clearly, it is outmatched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.86,2:05:41.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得承认 我入行以来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I have to say, in all my years of reporting,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:41.18,2:05:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没见过这样的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have never seen anything like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:45.20,2:05:46.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们尚不了解这支小分队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have limited information on the team{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.76,2:05:50.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但能认出亿万富翁托尼·斯塔克 也就是钢铁侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but we do know that billionaire Tony Stark's Iron Man...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:26.33,2:06:28.43,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,(呼叫失败){\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:00.68,2:07:02.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快回来啊 斯塔克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on, Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.20,2:07:13.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关门吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Close it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:32.52,2:07:33.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你小子行啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Son of a gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:38.04,2:07:39.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他根本没减速{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's not slowing down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.92,2:07:58.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还有呼吸吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is he breathing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:27.20,2:08:28.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什么啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:31.16,2:08:33.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What just happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:33.32,2:08:35.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人给我人工呼吸吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please tell me nobody kissed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:39.64,2:08:41.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们胜利了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We won.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:43.48,2:08:44.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好诶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, yay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:44.84,2:08:46.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万岁 干得好 伙计们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hurray. Good job, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:48.24,2:08:51.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们明天别来上班了 给自己放假一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's just not come in tomorrow. Let's just take a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:52.16,2:08:53.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃过土耳其烤肉吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you ever tried shawarma?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.08,2:08:56.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离这儿两条街有家土耳其烤肉店{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's a shawarma joint about two blocks from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:56.40,2:08:57.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我没吃过 但我想尝尝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know what it is, but I want to try it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:58.40,2:08:59.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没结束呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're not finished yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:04.56,2:09:06.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那待会儿去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then shawarma after.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:29.26,2:09:31.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你们不介意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If it's all the same to you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:34.58,2:09:36.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在想来一杯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll have that drink now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:43.74,2:09:45.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管城市饱受摧残{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Despite the devastation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:45.26,2:09:47.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这起已证实为外星入侵的袭击事件中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of what has been confirmed as an extraterrestrial attack,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:47.58,2:09:49.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这支名为复仇者联盟的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the extraordinary heroics{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:49.18,2:09:51.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小队的英雄壮举{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the group known as the Avengers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:51.60,2:09:53.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对很多人来说不仅是个安慰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}has been to many a cause not only for comfort,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:53.20,2:09:54.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更值得庆祝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but for celebration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:54.28,2:09:56.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道他们的存在真是太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's just really great knowing they're out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:56.72,2:09:58.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人在守护着我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That someone is watching over us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:59.20,2:10:00.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你 托尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love you, Thor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:00.48,2:10:02.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些怪物一通乱打{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then these guys were like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:02.24,2:10:03.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到处在爆炸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then the air goes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:03.64,2:10:04.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后那个绿色的家伙就…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And this green guy walks up and he goes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:05.08,2:10:06.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不清{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:06.20,2:10:08.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些家伙的存在让我觉得不安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't exactly feel safer with those things out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:08.68,2:10:11.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是有种被蒙在鼓里的感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It just seems that there's a lot they're not telling us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:11.76,2:10:15.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纽约有超级英雄 少来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Superheroes in New York? Give me a break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:15.16,2:10:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些所谓的英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These so-called "Heroes"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:17.72,2:10:21.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须为城市的损毁负责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}have to be held responsible for the destruction done to this city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:21.28,2:10:23.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们打完了仗 都跑哪去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This was their fight. Where are they now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:23.44,2:10:26.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们对复仇者联盟充满好奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tough questions are being asked about the Avengers themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:26.28,2:10:28.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然而他们却来如风 去无影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Their sudden appearance and equally sudden disappearance...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:28.80,2:10:31.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么 这事倒怪罪给他们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What, this is all somehow their fault?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:33.44,2:10:36.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国队长是我的救命恩人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Captain America saved my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:39.22,2:10:42.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管他在哪 不管他们都身处何方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wherever he is, and wherever any of them are,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:42.70,2:10:44.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:44.90,2:10:47.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想说声谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would want to say thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:49.46,2:10:50.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,复仇者都去哪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where are the Avengers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:51.02,2:10:53.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我暂时没去追查他们的行踪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not currently tracking their whereabouts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:54.20,2:10:56.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,依我看他们有权休假{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd say they've earned a leave of absence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:56.40,2:10:57.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙魔方呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the Tesseract?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:58.04,2:11:00.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙魔方已完璧归赵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Tesseract is where it belongs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:00.60,2:11:02.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能染指{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Out of our reach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:02.96,2:11:04.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你无权做这种决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's not your call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:05.20,2:11:06.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,决定不是我做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I didn't make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:06.32,2:11:08.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是没跟做这决定的神较劲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I just didn't argue with the god that did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:08.60,2:11:10.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就让他带走了魔方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, you let him take it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:10.44,2:11:13.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和本该为他的罪行受到制裁的战犯洛基{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the war criminal, Loki, who should be answering for his crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:13.88,2:11:16.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想他会受到制裁的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think he will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:30.28,2:11:32.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看你没意识到你这样做的后果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't think you understand what you've started,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:32.96,2:11:35.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么让复仇者回到社会上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}letting the Avengers loose on this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:35.84,2:11:36.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都是危险人物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:36.92,2:11:40.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实 他们的威名不仅传遍天下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They surely are, and the whole world knows it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:40.96,2:11:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更声振寰宇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Every world knows it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:43.84,2:11:45.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不正是我们的目的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was that the point of all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:45.96,2:11:47.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宣告我们不好欺负{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A statement?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:50.24,2:11:51.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是人若犯我 我必犯人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:01.70,2:12:03.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官 往后怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir, how does it work now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:04.26,2:12:06.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们各走各的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They've gone their separate ways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:06.30,2:12:09.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有的人还去了很远的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some, pretty extremely far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:09.82,2:12:11.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再遇到这种情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If we get into a situation like this again,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:11.78,2:12:13.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what happens then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:13.38,2:12:14.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们还会回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They'll come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:15.78,2:12:17.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有这把握吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you really sure about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:17.54,2:12:18.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:20.06,2:12:21.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:22.22,2:12:24.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们需要他们回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because we'll need them to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:17.20,2:15:19.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:20.84,2:15:24.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并不像他说的那样懦弱卑微{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are not the cowering wretches we were promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:25.92,2:15:27.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们坚守家园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:28.80,2:15:34.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能被驾驭 不甘受统治{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are unruly, and therefore cannot be ruled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:41.68,2:15:44.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与他们为敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To challenge them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:44.56,2:15:48.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无异于求死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is to court death.{\r}
